Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.80,0:00:45.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（六千五百万年前的白垩纪）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.85,0:02:29.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}巨齿鲨2：深渊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.85,0:02:29.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs21}本WEB版外挂字幕由  {\c&H9B30FF&}风吹来的那片云{\c&HFFFFFF&}  双语合并
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.44,0:02:35.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（现今）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.66,0:02:51.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an9\fs12}? Pressure pushing down on me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.96,0:02:56.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an9\fs12}? Pressing down on you No man ask for ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.88,0:03:01.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an9\fs12}? Under pressure That burns a building down ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.09,0:03:03.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an9\fs12}? Splits a family in two ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.35,0:03:04.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an9\fs12}? Puts people on streets ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.65,0:03:16.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an9\fs12}? It's the terror of knowing ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.11,0:03:18.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an9\fs12}? What this world is about ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.40,0:03:20.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an9\fs12}? Watching some good friends ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.49,0:03:22.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an9\fs12}? Screaming, "Let me out"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.41,0:03:26.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an9\fs12}? Pray tomorrow Gets me higher ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.91,0:03:31.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an9\fs12}? Pressure on people People on streets ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.16,0:03:35.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（菲律宾海）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.33,0:03:37.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（有毒废弃物）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.92,0:03:39.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这东西超毒的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's highly toxic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.29,0:03:42.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点 小子 继续搬运 不要停\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, lads, keep it moving. Keep it moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.75,0:03:45.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（蓝猫号）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.30,0:03:46.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点 快点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.43,0:03:49.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搬这个有双倍酬劳吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is this double pay or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.97,0:03:51.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟是有毒废弃物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There is toxic waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.93,0:04:00.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你杵在那里干嘛 都到船边了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing sitting there, mate?  You're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.56,0:04:03.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点把这些垃圾丢下船\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I want this filth off my ship as fast as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.42,0:04:25.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在干嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What you doing, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.71,0:04:27.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坏坏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Naughty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.88,0:04:30.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来人啊 来人啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.47,0:04:32.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坏坏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Naughty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.30,0:04:36.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭上你的鸟嘴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Keep your little beak shut. Not very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.89,0:04:37.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-真不乖 -不然丢你下海\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Otherwise, you'll go for a swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.97,0:04:40.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来人啊 来人啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.89,0:04:42.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快来救我 快来救我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Help me! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.19,0:04:45.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干得好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.06,0:04:47.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是总部派我来的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm here from the home office.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.52,0:04:48.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放屁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.65,0:04:51.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来这里检查安全协定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here checking on, uh, security protocols...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.65,0:04:54.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顺便拍几张照片 笑一个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and, um, taking a few pictures, so smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.95,0:04:57.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们在里面干嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.99,0:04:59.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-真不乖 -这是怎么回事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-  Not very nice. - What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.62,0:05:04.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.62,0:05:05.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要抓住你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll get you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.55,0:05:16.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 快去帮忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, hey! Get at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.36,0:05:34.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-上去 -抓住他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-  Get up. -  Get Him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.15,0:05:39.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个往左边 拦截他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You two, go left! Cut him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.28,0:05:41.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定要把他抓到 死的也行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I want him caught, dead or dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.16,0:05:47.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别走那里 绕过去 绕过去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not there! Go around! Go around!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.50,0:05:51.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 兄弟 游戏结束了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There you go, mate. End of the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.08,0:05:54.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.67,0:05:56.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们都被捕了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're all under arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.75,0:05:59.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罪名是非法倾倒放射性毒物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}For the illegal dumping of radioactive materials.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.55,0:06:02.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 你 你 你 你和你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, you, you, you, you and you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.68,0:06:06.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么 我和他还有他 跟他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What, me and... and him, and him? And him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.64,0:06:10.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-杀了他 -等等 等等\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Kill him. -  Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.51,0:06:13.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你们想看逮捕令\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know. You want to see the warrant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.69,0:06:14.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在我口袋里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's right in my pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.73,0:06:18.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们法庭上见 好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll see you in court, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.61,0:06:27.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里偏离航运线 离海岸还有两百浬\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're out of shipping lanes, and you're 200 miles from shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.65,0:06:29.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祝你游个痛快\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So enjoy your swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.66,0:06:36.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到他了 就在左舷边\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've got him. Just off the port side.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.17,0:06:40.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就像环保版007 我喜欢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's like a green James Bond. I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.88,0:06:46.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 我的帽子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no, my hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.30,0:06:48.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 蠢蛋们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello, suckers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.55,0:06:49.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来他交了很多新朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Looks like he's been making friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.13,0:06:52.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管走到哪 他都一样受欢迎\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wherever he goes, people just love him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.64,0:06:53.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天知道为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}God knows why.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.06,0:07:00.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能搞定吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you got this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.35,0:07:02.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等着瞧吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.32,0:07:06.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许这不是最好的主意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe this wasn't the best idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.40,0:07:08.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许这不是最好的主意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe this isn't the best idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.07,0:07:10.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一定会很棒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is gonna be awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.90,0:07:12.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解释一下很棒的定义\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Define "awesome."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.32,0:07:13.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我正要示范\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm about to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.20,0:07:16.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开启舱门\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Opening hatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.97,0:07:33.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下次给这东西多充点气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Next time, put a little more air in this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.93,0:07:35.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好像用吸管在呼吸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's like breathing through a straw.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.47,0:07:36.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但的确有用 不是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Worked, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.97,0:07:37.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.68,0:07:41.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若你热爱自己职业 就永远不觉得辛苦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If you love your job, you'll never work a day in your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.19,0:07:46.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（万溟鲸灵研究所 海南高科技产业园）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.11,0:07:49.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 把15号测试品带进来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, bring in Test 15.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.94,0:07:51.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开启机甲动力\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Initiating suit power-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.69,0:07:52.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,净空\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.61,0:07:56.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很有潜力\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Promising.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.49,0:08:04.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外骨骼机甲的表现超出我们预期 九溟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The exo suit is performing way beyond what we expected, Jiuming.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.42,0:08:10.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,动力增加了21%\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}21% increase in power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.17,0:08:13.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不错吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not bad, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.38,0:08:14.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常酷\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.34,0:08:20.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我等不及要在海沟中使用\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't wait to use these in the trench.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.51,0:08:24.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.26,0:08:26.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么指示\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's up favourite niece?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.68,0:08:28.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚你能别迟到吗 舅\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm supposed to tell you not to be late for the party tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.06,0:08:31.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能 你交代的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.90,0:08:35.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-或许加到25 -好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-  Maybe 25. Hmm? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.03,0:08:38.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是认真的 别迟到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean it, don't be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.62,0:08:50.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你人生活到这一步 还不会打领带也太扯了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I cannot believe you got this far in life without knowing how to tie a tie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.50,0:08:54.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首先 不要夸大我的人生进程\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}First, let's not overstate how far I've gotten in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.37,0:08:57.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其次 干我这行不需要穿西装\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Second, never involved wearing a monkey suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.84,0:08:59.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-完美 你看起来超帅 -谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Perfect. You look great. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.05,0:09:01.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许你能开始习惯社交\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ah. Maybe this is the start of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.38,0:09:03.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别想太多\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't count on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.01,0:09:08.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.56,0:09:15.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个人你眼熟吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That guy look familiar to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.44,0:09:16.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不熟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.56,0:09:20.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我不喜欢他 -你谁都不喜欢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-  I don't like him. - You don't like anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.23,0:09:22.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就喜欢你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.23,0:09:23.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我总是替你擦屁股\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's 'cause I save your life all the time...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.11,0:09:26.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你买酒喝 还在酒吧斗殴时支援你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I buy you beers and I back you up in bar fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.53,0:09:28.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你是很特别的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's 'cause you're a special guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.66,0:09:29.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们都很特别\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're both special.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.41,0:09:32.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-祝我好运 -祝你好运\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Wish me luck. -  Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.08,0:09:33.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感谢捐款\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks for the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.08,0:09:34.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女士们先生们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.04,0:09:38.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎来到本海洋研究所的十周年庆\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}welcome to the 10th anniversary of the Oceanic Institute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.79,0:09:39.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是希拉蕊德斯科\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm Hilary Driscoll.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.50,0:09:43.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感谢各位今晚的光临 并与我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you for coming tonight, and for joining me
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.80,0:09:47.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一起赞助这项惊人的研究\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}in funding this incredible work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.30,0:09:49.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停 别搓来蹭去的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Stop. Don't fidget.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.84,0:09:52.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为何必须出席这活动\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why exactly do I have to be up here anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.81,0:09:55.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你很合群\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}'Cause you're a team player.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.35,0:09:57.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好极了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.10,0:10:03.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请掌声热烈欢迎本研究所的所长\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Please give a warm welcome to the director of the Institute...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.52,0:10:06.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,张九溟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...Zhang Jiuming.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.65,0:10:10.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 希拉蕊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you, Hilary.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.87,0:10:17.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明朝的大文人宋濂说…\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}As the great poet Song Lian said...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.41,0:10:21.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,「上凌霄汉 下烛九溟」\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Man is limited only by his imagination."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.58,0:10:26.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爸给我取名叫九溟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My father named me Jiuming,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.09,0:10:30.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意思是海洋或者深渊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}which means ocean or abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.72,0:10:37.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爸我姐毕生都在研究海洋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My father and my sister spent their lives studying the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.80,0:10:42.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可惜年轻的时候我不懂事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It wasn't until they were both gone that I began to wonder
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.64,0:10:44.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到他们都走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}what my purpose was.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.23,0:10:47.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才开始琢磨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But through Suyin's daughter Meiying,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.19,0:10:48.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己为什么活着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I saw that there was a future.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.15,0:10:54.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把父亲的研究所 和我的万溟鲸灵公司合并\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I merged my father's research institute with my company
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.57,0:11:00.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是为了要发扬 中国人这种探索未知世界的精神\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}to carry forward the spirit of exploring the unknown in their honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.25,0:11:06.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,值此十周年之际\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}To mark this tenth anniversary,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.96,0:11:09.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想向大家介绍一位真正的大美女\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I want to introduce you all to someone very special.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.01,0:11:19.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它叫海琪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Her name is Haiqi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.51,0:11:22.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们发现它的时候 它受了伤\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She is the world's only megalodon in captivity.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.30,0:11:24.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,于是我们把它带回来治疗扶养\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We found her injured as a pup.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.35,0:11:28.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,海琪变得很热情 它邀请我们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks to Haiqi, we've learned a tremendous amount about the megalodons
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.52,0:11:29.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去它家作客\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}as well as the trench where they live.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.06,0:11:31.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（潜艇一号）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.52,0:11:34.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多亏了我们支持者的慷慨捐助\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks to the generous donations from our supporters,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.15,0:11:39.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得以开发出穿越温跃层的技术\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}we have been able to create the technology to pass through the thermocline,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.78,0:11:45.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这层冰冷的海水 将海琪的世界与我们世界隔开\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}a thermal layer of freezing cold water that separates Haiqi's world from ours
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.33,0:11:49.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并潜入海平面以下六千米的海沟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and into a trench 6,000 meters below sea level.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.62,0:11:53.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多亏了各位 让我们能比以往走得更远\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks to you, we have the ability to go further than ever before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.79,0:11:57.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保护海洋 对中国 对人类 都很重要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Love the ocean and protect the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.71,0:11:58.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.21,0:12:02.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也谢谢你 张九溟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And thank you. Zhang Jiuming.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.88,0:12:05.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以感谢大家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, thank you all
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.55,0:12:10.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和我们一起保护这神奇的生态系统\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}for being part of protecting this incredible ecosystem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.68,0:12:12.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感谢光临\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.06,0:12:16.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认为那里有 更多的海底生物被发现\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you think there are more creatures to be discovered down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.19,0:12:18.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,必须的须啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There has to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.02,0:12:21.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有谁想跟曾与巨齿鲨搏斗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who wants to get a selfie with the man
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.32,0:12:24.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并成功存活的男人合影自拍\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}who fought a megalodon and lived to tell the tale?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.32,0:12:27.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女士们先生们 请欢迎乔纳斯泰勒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We give you, ladies and gentlemen, Jonas Taylor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.45,0:12:29.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在那里 他在那里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There he is! There he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.03,0:12:34.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这是你的主意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know this was your idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.25,0:12:36.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要杀了你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.83,0:12:38.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,微笑 并假装你乐在其中\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Smile and pretend you love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.58,0:12:40.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来啊 给他一个抱抱和搔搔痒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Go on, give him a hug. Give him a tickle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.71,0:12:43.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他最爱拥抱群众了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, he loves people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.51,0:12:57.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想跟你一起去玛纳一号\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wanna go to Mana One with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.06,0:12:59.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想潜入海沟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I want to dive the trench.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.56,0:13:01.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.69,0:13:03.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 玫盈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sorry, Meiying.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.61,0:13:05.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.98,0:13:08.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我妈在我这年纪时就常潜水\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mom was diving all the time at my age.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.86,0:13:10.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但不是潜两万五千呎\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not to 25,000 feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.20,0:13:14.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意思是太危险\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Saying it's too dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.20,0:13:15.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对你来说太危险\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Too dangerous for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.66,0:13:17.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但实际上并不危险\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But not dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.79,0:13:21.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在心理学上 这叫“认知失调”\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}In psychology, they call that "cognitive dissonance."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.12,0:13:24.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在现实世界中 这叫“父母心”\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}In the real world, they call it "parenting."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.92,0:13:28.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你需要开始认真地 把我当成科学家看待\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You need to start taking me seriously as a scientist.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.71,0:13:29.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你才14岁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're 14.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.96,0:13:30.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.51,0:13:35.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我熟知玛纳一号上的每个系统 每个潜水协议\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know every system on Mana One, every dive protocol
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.38,0:13:37.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以及在那里看到的每种动物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and every animal we've seen down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.43,0:13:41.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着 你可以登上玛纳一号\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, look. You can come to Mana One.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.97,0:13:44.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从旁观测我们潜水\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}To observe the dive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.06,0:13:47.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仅此而已\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.31,0:13:50.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,九溟跑去和巨齿鲨共游了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jiuming is swimming with the meg.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.07,0:13:53.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,舅舅\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.53,0:13:56.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,海琪的生命指数飙高\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Haiqi's vitals are elevated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.28,0:13:58.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心点 它知道你也在水中\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Be careful, she's definitely aware of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.16,0:14:04.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,九溟 你为何要与巨齿鲨共游\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why are you swimming with the meg, Jiuming?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.29,0:14:07.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我正在进行一项实验\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm conducting an experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.54,0:14:09.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而实验叫“我好吃吗 ”\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is the experiment "Do I taste good?"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.00,0:14:13.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,舅 你疯啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uncle, are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.42,0:14:14.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.84,0:14:17.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从海琪小时候就开始训练它了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've been training Haiqi since she was a pup.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.17,0:14:19.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你无法驯服巨齿鲨 九溟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A meg is not trainable, Jiuming.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.93,0:14:23.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若你想在外甥女面前被吃掉 请便吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But if you wanna be eaten in front of your niece, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.30,0:14:26.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我赌五十元结果会是悲剧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fifty bucks says this is gonna end badly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.64,0:14:27.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我赌了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll take that action.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.10,0:14:29.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我押鲨鱼队赢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I am all in for team shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.94,0:14:33.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么 不能押鲨鱼赢 那算造孽\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? You can't bet on a shark, man. That's bad karma.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.77,0:14:35.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托各位 专心工作 这样不好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, guys, focus. That's not cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.86,0:14:40.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,九溟 良心建议这主意真的糟透了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jiuming... I'd like to respectfully suggest that this is truly a terrible idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.74,0:14:42.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巨齿鲨和人类根本不该相交\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Megs and humanity were never meant to mix.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.24,0:14:46.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我与海琪心有灵犀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Haiqi and I have a special bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.95,0:14:48.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们瞧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.29,0:14:53.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,按一次响片代表过来 按两次响片代表离开\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}One click to come. Two clicks to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.57,0:15:26.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈啊 我觉得它在看我们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whoa. I think she's looking at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.20,0:15:35.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.62,0:15:39.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它绕回来了 心率飙高\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's coming around. Heart rate is up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.96,0:15:41.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快速迫近\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Moving in fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.33,0:15:42.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（九溟 海琪）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.30,0:15:47.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四百米\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Four hundred meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.14,0:15:56.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,悠悠的 悠悠的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Slowly, slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.64,0:16:01.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-九溟 它完全没回应 -听话 海琪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jiuming, she's not responding. Come on, Haiqi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.02,0:16:02.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两百米\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Two hundred meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.23,0:16:07.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一百米\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}One hundred meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.86,0:16:08.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,九溟 快闪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jiuming, move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.98,0:16:10.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来不及了 它速度太快了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's too late. She's coming in too fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.99,0:16:12.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五十米\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fifty meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.28,0:16:14.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快拉安全索\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pull the cord.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.24,0:16:16.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,二十米\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Twenty meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.24,0:16:17.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-九溟 快离开 -舅 不要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jiuming, get out of there! Uncle, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.92,0:16:25.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它咬到他了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did it get him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.09,0:16:27.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道 我不敢看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know. I couldn't watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.71,0:16:29.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不见了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.38,0:16:33.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就说这是个馊主意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I knew this was a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.22,0:16:40.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刺激吗 亲\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Total success.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.64,0:16:44.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,舅舅 你脑袋进水啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uncle! Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.60,0:16:45.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这不没事吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's all right, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.48,0:16:49.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那很刺激 对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That was exciting, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.77,0:16:53.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道它是怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't figure out what's wrong with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.73,0:16:55.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它这整周的行为都很异常\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's been acting strangely all week.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.44,0:16:57.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算你把响片按烂也没用\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You can clickety-click all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.57,0:17:00.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,症结是 它是一只巨齿鲨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The problem is that it's a meg.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.57,0:17:01.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你是点心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you're a snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.95,0:17:03.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.37,0:17:06.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,重点是 你把玫盈吓坏了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}For the record, you scared the hell out of Meiying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.62,0:17:09.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也好意思训我 你跑去那艘船上干嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're one to talk. What were you doing on that ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.92,0:17:12.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了 别告诉我 我不想知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Actually, don't tell me. I don't wanna know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.00,0:17:16.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本研究所的宗旨就是保护海洋 对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, the Institute's mandate is to protect the oceans, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.72,0:17:20.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能参与任何非法活动\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We can't be a part of any illegal activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.05,0:17:22.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我最厌恶违法乱纪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I abhor lawlessness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.55,0:17:23.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是喔 那好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.47,0:17:26.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,特别是非法倾倒放射性废弃物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Especially the illegal dumping of radioactive waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.56,0:17:31.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随着每次行动 风险都会增加\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're taking bigger and bigger risks each time you go out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.48,0:17:33.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这点上我们还蛮有共识的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I guess we both know about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.77,0:17:36.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这完全不一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.44,0:17:39.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的行为 风险是可预估的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}With me, there's a calculation of risks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.95,0:17:43.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不这么认为\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not that I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.17,0:17:58.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想念你妈妈吗 大鱼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you miss your mom, big fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.30,0:18:04.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备好前往玛纳一号了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you ready for Mana One?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.22,0:18:08.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我随时 主要看大小姐的胆气啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, whenever you're ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.22,0:18:12.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有了这玩意 我们在水底下可以安全去任何地方\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}These new suits will let us travel anywhere and at any depth underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.60,0:18:14.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你瞧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.27,0:18:18.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.44,0:18:19.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事 没事 没事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No worries, no worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.36,0:18:28.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我妈和姥爷经常提到你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mom and Grandpa talked about you all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.24,0:18:32.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都怎么骂我的啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nothing good I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.79,0:18:34.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你猜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wanna guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.62,0:18:38.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看见这个疤了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See this scar?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.96,0:18:42.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我11岁的时候 趁着老师忙着做实验\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When I was 11 my father was busy in the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.17,0:18:45.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偷着约了个小伙伴 去乱石滩游野泳\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I snuck out to swim with my friends on the rocky shores...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.96,0:18:47.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,缝了九针\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and had to get nine stitches as a result of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.22,0:18:50.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回到家 老头狠狠地教训了我一顿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When I returned home my father taught me a real lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.18,0:18:53.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我姥爷\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.22,0:18:54.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.47,0:18:56.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慈眉善目是对你这个外孙女\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He was kind to you because you're his granddaughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.01,0:18:58.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对亲儿子 他狠着呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but he was tough on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.93,0:19:04.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我长大以后 考大学 开公司 自己创业\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So after college, I started a company.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.06,0:19:07.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只想跑得离他越远越好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wanted to get away from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.73,0:19:11.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,忽然有一天 很多年都不联系的他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I hadn't had any contact with your grandfather for many years.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.03,0:19:14.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你妈给我送了这幅字\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Then he asked your mum to bring me this calligraphy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.62,0:19:17.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,“四海游龙”\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Dragon travelling across the Four Seas."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.58,0:19:20.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为他是在嘲笑我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I thought it was a form of ridicule...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.29,0:19:25.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到他们都走了 我才知道自己有多蠢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but I came to realize that he wanted me to find my own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.17,0:19:30.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这四个字也送给你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Like the dragon...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.80,0:19:33.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望你自由地 主宰自己的命运\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I hope you can find your own fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.13,0:19:35.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地勤人员 我们正接近玛纳一号\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ground crew, we're approaching Mana One.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.18,0:19:38.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 芮格斯 欢迎你回来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Rigas. Good to have you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.51,0:19:39.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想念你们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I missed you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.89,0:19:41.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备好要去潜水了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you ready to do some diving?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.06,0:19:43.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那还用说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.22,0:19:46.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（玛纳一号海洋研究基地）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.66,0:20:05.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（海琪）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.37,0:20:48.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家早安 让我们开始水下任务吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Morning, everyone. Let's get this show underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.83,0:20:51.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,潜艇一号与潜艇二号 准备下潜两万五千呎\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dive 1 and Dive 2, descend to 25,000 feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.66,0:20:53.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本次任务要探索第19区\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're exploring Area 19.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.54,0:20:55.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收集岩石样本并记录任何新物种\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Collecting rock samples and logging any new species.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.00,0:20:58.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,20分钟后开始下潜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Diving in T-minus 20 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.17,0:21:01.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全员请仔细进行目视和扫描 就像常规那样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All eyes open for a straightforward sweep and scan. The usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.96,0:21:03.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是喔 水底没有常规可言\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. There's no usual down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.22,0:21:05.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,系统启动\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}System's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.13,0:21:10.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兰斯 你在中控台周围 挂满玩具是怎么回事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's with all these toys you have hanging around your console, Lance?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.14,0:21:14.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些不是玩具 它们是公仔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They're not toys, they're figurines.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.64,0:21:16.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们绝对是玩具 兰斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They are definitely toys, Lance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.98,0:21:17.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.65,0:21:26.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备好下水了吗 各位\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ready for the drop, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.47,0:21:52.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你和莎尔会去参加动漫展吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, are you and Sal, like, Comic-Con guys or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.76,0:21:55.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全正确 会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, absolutely right. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.14,0:21:58.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会做角色扮演吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you, um, dress up?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.14,0:21:59.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.14,0:22:03.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别跟他聊这个 除非你想看一百万张照片\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't get him started, unless you want to see a million photographs.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.90,0:22:05.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊 麻烦你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yes, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.40,0:22:06.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,专心工作 各位\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Stay focused, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.03,0:22:11.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超越一万七千呎\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Passing 17,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.19,0:22:12.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,遥测数据正常\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Telemetry's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.70,0:22:18.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又是海底美好的一天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's a beautiful day in the neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.83,0:22:25.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超越一万八千呎\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Passing 18,000 feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.79,0:22:27.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有系统运作正常\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All systems nominal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.21,0:22:30.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,组员们 状况不错 请打开我们今天要勘测的座标\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Looking good, team. Let's pull up the grids we're gonna map today.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.96,0:22:34.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第19区 我们什么时候才能看不同的东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Area 19. When are we going to look at something different?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.34,0:22:36.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟还有大约一百区需要探索\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, there's like 100 more sectors to explore.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.43,0:22:38.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乔纳斯 你能确认氧气水平吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jonas, can you confirm O2 levels?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.89,0:22:41.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,消耗量超过任务规格11%\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Consumption is 11% over mission spec.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.97,0:22:44.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜芮格斯很紧张\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Guess Rigas is nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.43,0:22:46.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是因为你总用嘴巴呼吸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}More like you're a mouth breather.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.35,0:22:47.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他真的是那样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He totally is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.60,0:22:49.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-从这里都能感受到你呼出的气 -对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can feel the breeze from over here. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.94,0:22:53.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首先 那个叫作鼻中膈弯曲\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Firstly, it's called a deviated septum.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.44,0:22:58.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再者 我清楚记得是在 从70呎巨齿鲨的口中\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Second, I distinctly remember deviating it while saving your ungrateful ass
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.32,0:23:00.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救下你时才弄弯的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}from a 70-foot megalodon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.37,0:23:03.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超越两万呎 接近温跃层\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Passing 20,000 feet. Approaching the thermocline.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.91,0:23:08.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,检查氧气管路和槽压\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Checking O2 lines and tank pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.04,0:23:11.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若真有外泄 读数会出现波动\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, if there was a leak, there would be a fluctuation on the readings.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.37,0:23:12.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这里完全没看到异常\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not seeing anything here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.63,0:23:14.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,检查辅助氧气储槽的压力\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Check the pressure on the auxiliary O2 tanks. Okay, I'll check again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.17,0:23:19.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问题不在那里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's not the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.97,0:23:21.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乔纳斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, Jonas?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.39,0:23:24.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玫盈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Meiying?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.18,0:23:26.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你搞什么鬼啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.35,0:23:27.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You gotta be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.27,0:23:32.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看得出来你很生气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I see that you're angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.23,0:23:35.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我深信这个决定非常合理而且负责\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I believe that this is a reasonable and responsible decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.69,0:23:36.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停止下潜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Stop the dive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.48,0:23:39.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全数暂停\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Full stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.03,0:23:42.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但在你开始吼人前 我想说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But before you start yelling, can I just say...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.20,0:23:45.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我14岁时也做了很多蠢事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I did all kinds of stupid things when I was 14.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.41,0:23:47.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果我还不是好好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And look how I turned out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.33,0:23:49.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,返回海平面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're surfacing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.33,0:23:50.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我不明白为何不行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I don't see what the problem is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.04,0:23:53.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是你第26次进行海沟潜水 而且从无事故\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is your 26th trench dive without incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.75,0:23:56.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,潜艇配有电流掠食者防御系统 和紧急潜水机甲\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Subs have electric predator countermeasures, and emergency dive suits.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.92,0:23:57.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但没带你那份\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Which you don't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.25,0:23:59.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.13,0:24:03.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在你们开行前会时准备了一套\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I packed one while you were doing the pre-dive meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.80,0:24:04.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.05,0:24:10.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你或许应该先乖乖坐好 保持安静\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}now's maybe a good time to, uh, sit down and be quiet for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.31,0:24:11.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以自己系安全带\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can do a seatbelt by myself, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.06,0:24:12.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你可以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.06,0:24:14.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乔纳斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jonas.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.06,0:24:16.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不归你管 九溟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not your call, Jiuming.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.52,0:24:17.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有访客了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We've got company.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.02,0:24:20.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各位 是一只巨齿鲨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Guys, it's a meg.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.77,0:24:22.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快速迫近\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Approaching fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.19,0:24:24.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不可能 它们无法通过温跃层\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's not possible. they can't go through the thermocline.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.94,0:24:27.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它不是来自温跃层 我是从岸边追踪它过来的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not come from the thermocline. I'm tracking it from the shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.57,0:24:30.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,立刻全速下潜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dive! Flank speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.45,0:24:33.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,执行 重组电池阵列\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Engaging. Rerouting battery array.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.49,0:24:35.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓紧了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.62,0:24:39.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开启掠食者防御系统\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Charging the predator countermeasures.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.29,0:24:40.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,充好电前我们就会先阵亡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We'll be dead before they're online.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.75,0:24:43.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,温跃层是我们唯一的出路\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thermocline's our only hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.71,0:24:45.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看到海琪追踪器的读数\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm reading Haiqi's tracker.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.29,0:24:46.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（潜艇一号 海琪 潜艇二号）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.84,0:24:48.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不可能\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.05,0:24:50.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能的刚变成可能了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, impossible just got possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.88,0:24:52.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,距离温跃层五百米\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Five hundred meters to the thermocline.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.34,0:24:53.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,海琪正快速迫近\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Haiqi's closing fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.30,0:24:55.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一百米\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}One hundred meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.39,0:24:56.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它就在我们正上方\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's right above us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.72,0:24:59.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加油 加油啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.98,0:25:01.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进入温跃层\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Entering the thermocline.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.23,0:25:03.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,潜艇一号 潜艇二号\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dive 1, Dive 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.60,0:25:06.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,切换低频光 你们不会想吸引更多的巨齿鲨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Switch to low-frequency light. you don't want to attract any more megs.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.07,0:25:09.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它失去踪迹了 它无法跟着我们过来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've lost her. She can't follow us through.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.57,0:25:10.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can she?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.73,0:25:12.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,暂停通讯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Going dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.24,0:25:14.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从没用60节的速度穿越温跃层过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've never crossed the thermocline at 60 knots.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.03,0:25:18.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心 你可不想烧坏引擎\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Careful. You don't want to burn out the engines.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.12,0:25:21.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别担心 我不会弄坏这豪华的玩具\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't worry, I'm not gonna break the pretty toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.92,0:25:31.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.26,0:25:34.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（潜艇一号 潜艇二号 海琪）
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.01,0:25:37.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它还在跟着我们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's still on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.22,0:25:38.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三十秒后\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thirty seconds
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.30,0:25:39.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,防御系统上线\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}for the countermeasures.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.60,0:25:40.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回避\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Evasive.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.64,0:25:41.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它一定是追踪了我们的热讯号\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She must have followed our heat signature.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.24,0:26:04.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,九溟 你的宠物鲨鱼是怎么下来的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How did your pet shark get down here, Jiuming?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.58,0:26:06.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它一定是逃脱了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She must have escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.24,0:26:07.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是怎么发生的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How did that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.96,0:26:09.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,掠食者防御系统启动\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Predator countermeasures active.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.12,0:26:12.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迫近警报\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Proximity alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.71,0:26:13.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多只巨齿鲨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Megs.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.59,0:26:17.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.97,0:26:31.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是我见过最大的巨齿鲨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's the biggest meg I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.52,0:26:34.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是任何人见过最大的巨齿鲨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Biggest meg anyone's ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.27,0:26:37.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它一定是顶级掠食者\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's gotta be the apex predator.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.36,0:26:43.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可思议 巨齿鲨是独居动物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Incredible. Megs are solitary.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.11,0:26:45.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们仿佛是被召唤来此\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's like they're being called.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.20,0:26:50.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变更原定潜水计画 我们得去看看它们要干嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm changing the dive plan. We have to see what they're up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.83,0:26:52.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那玫盈怎么办\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And what about Meiying?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.75,0:26:54.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我赞成去看看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I vote we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.00,0:26:56.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人在问你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wasn't asking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.25,0:26:59.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目前的氧气储备量还在最大值\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oxygen reserves are at maximum.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.50,0:27:01.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,掠食者防御系统也已布署\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Predator countermeasures are deployed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.09,0:27:03.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目前的我们绝对安全\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right now we are perfectly safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.09,0:27:05.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是目前而已\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right now, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.97,0:27:09.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若我发现任何危险 就会立刻中止任务\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If I see anything dangerous, I'm pulling the plug.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.89,0:27:12.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麦克 我们要更改任务内容\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mac, we're changing the mission profile.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.26,0:27:14.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前往227航向\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Proceeding on heading 227.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.52,0:27:17.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们已经偏离原任务了 至少得留在原航道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, they're already off mission. They need to stay on course.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.35,0:27:19.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乔纳斯 你们已远远驶出勘测过的区域\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jonas, you're going way outside the sector we have already mapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.65,0:27:21.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是一次探索任务\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is an exploration mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.61,0:27:23.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我们前去探索\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let's explore.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.27,0:27:25.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.36,0:27:26.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,睁大眼睛 注意后方动静\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Eyes open, watch your backs.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.61,0:27:27.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是在说笑吧 麦克\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really, Mac?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.15,0:27:31.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要跟着巨型鲨前往未知区域\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, we're gonna follow some giant sharks to a unknown sector?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.70,0:27:33.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Man...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.37,0:27:36.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这行为蠢毙了 记住我的警告\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This some dumbass shit, mark my words.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.92,0:27:43.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进入第21区\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Entering sector 21.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.14,0:28:02.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开始地理扫描\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Commencing geographical scan.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.27,0:28:05.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里好美\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.52,0:28:09.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你妈超爱这地方\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Your mum loved this place more than anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.28,0:28:12.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很高兴终于亲眼看到了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm glad I finally get to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.24,0:28:16.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别太习惯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.16,0:28:19.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的余生都被禁足了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're grounded for the rest of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.79,0:28:21.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也爱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I love you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.75,0:28:26.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,海琪维持领先四百米\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Haiqi 400 meters ahead and holding.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.83,0:28:28.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在要去哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Where are we going now?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.29,0:28:29.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进入未知领域\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Into the unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.00,0:28:32.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那正是我们此行的目的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's what we came for.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.80,0:28:34.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,海琪的追踪讯号在前方\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've got Haiqi's tracker ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.55,0:28:36.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它好像在兜圈子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Looks like she's circling.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.02,0:28:49.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看上方\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.94,0:28:51.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们在依循本能聚集\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's some instinctual gathering.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.06,0:28:53.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太惊人了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.03,0:28:56.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们是来此交配的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They're here to mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.15,0:28:59.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以海琪最近行为才会那么反常\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is why Haiqi has been acting strangely.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.91,0:29:02.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好极了 更多的巨齿鲨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, great. More megs.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.46,0:29:11.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,扫描仪检测到异常结构\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The scanner's detecting an abnormal structure.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.17,0:29:20.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.93,0:29:22.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是艘沉船吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is that a wreck?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.68,0:29:27.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是某种海底基地\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's some kind of sea floor station.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.26,0:29:29.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,建在这里是想要干嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What could they be doing down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.85,0:29:35.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,芮格斯 进行全仪器扫瞄\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rigas, run all spectrums.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.56,0:29:36.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（红外线 热能扫描）\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, that's no wreck.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.07,0:29:40.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是沉船残骸 上面有热讯号\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm getting heat signatures off it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.82,0:29:42.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是看不到里面有什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just can't see what's inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.57,0:29:44.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多个气闸舱 全区供电\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Multiple airlocks, power generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.95,0:29:47.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能做到这样需要很大的资本\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The resources needed is staggering.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.45,0:29:51.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁会拥有这种技术\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who would even have that technology?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.91,0:29:55.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,声纳显示我们上方有东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sonar says there's something above us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.04,0:29:57.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来像一艘潜艇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It looks like a submarine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.88,0:29:59.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们去看看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let's take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.38,0:30:02.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,炸药已就位 正在准备爆炸区域\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Charges set. Priming zone for detonation.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.42,0:30:04.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点 我们得炸平这海脊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on. We need to blow this ridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.13,0:30:06.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啦 知道了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.80,0:30:08.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也不想在外面待太久\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We don't wanna be down here any longer than needs be.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.22,0:30:14.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁叫这是唯一可以开采这东西的地方\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, well, this is the only place to mine this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.39,0:30:18.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢慢来 别搞砸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Slow and steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.48,0:30:20.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蒙提斯 为什么你可以待在潜艇里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Montes. Why do you get to stay in the submarine?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.19,0:30:24.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是当队长的特权\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's good to be the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.69,0:30:26.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,检测有物体迫近\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Incoming object detected.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.41,0:30:30.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放大四百倍\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Zoom in 400%.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.16,0:30:34.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（四百倍聚焦）
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.62,0:30:43.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛纳一号组员出现在下方\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mana One crew is below us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.25,0:30:47.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们肯定已经发现基地了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's no way they haven't seen the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.50,0:30:48.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们该怎么办\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.01,0:30:51.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在就启动炸药\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm arming the explosives right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.59,0:30:52.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们得立刻撤离\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You have to get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.80,0:30:54.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么 等等 你不能那样做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Wait, no, you can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.93,0:30:56.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来不及 你明知我们来不及\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There isn't time. You know there isn't time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.64,0:30:58.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要十分钟才能撤离爆炸区\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It will take ten minutes to get clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.56,0:31:00.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蒙提斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Montes!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.52,0:31:08.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉了 各位\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sorry, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.82,0:31:10.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蒙提斯 蒙提斯 别这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Montes! Montes, don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.36,0:31:15.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.82,0:31:18.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坍塌\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Landslide!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.16,0:31:21.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我无法绕过它 只能直接穿越\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't get ahead of it. I'm gonna have to go through.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.98,0:31:57.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各位 发生什么事了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Guys? What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.57,0:31:59.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,读数显示温跃层破裂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm reading a thermocline breach.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.45,0:32:01.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有东西在上面炸开一个大洞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Something's ripped a giant hole in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.58,0:32:14.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,重组推进器 我们只能这样了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rerouting the thrusters. This is all we've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.51,0:32:22.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,垂直控制功能失灵\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Vertical control is down.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.97,0:32:24.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,液压系统失去回应\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hydraulics are non-responsive.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.31,0:32:29.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们被卡死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're pinned.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.14,0:32:32.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们来搞定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.44,0:32:36.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-稳住潜艇 -好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-  Hold us steady. -  Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.31,0:32:41.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,九溟 在下方六十度\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jiuming. Sixty degrees down.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.86,0:32:43.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前方两呎处\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Two feet forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.12,0:32:47.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,九溟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jiuming!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.25,0:32:58.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快驶离\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.59,0:33:01.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全速前进 全速前进\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Full thrust! Full thrust!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.72,0:33:13.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,九溟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jiuming!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.27,0:33:16.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.28,0:33:28.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,遥测数据归零\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's no telemetry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.86,0:33:33.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,潜艇一号 潜艇二号 收到请回答\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dive 1, Dive 2. Do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.03,0:33:36.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,潜艇一号 潜艇二号 收到请回答\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dive 1, Dive 2. Do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.87,0:33:40.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仪表上什么都扫不到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We've got nothing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.29,0:33:45.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续努力 DJ 洁丝 立刻准备救援潜艇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Keep trying, DJ. Jess, prep the rescue sub. Stat.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.30,0:33:46.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底发生什么事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ugh, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.55,0:33:47.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.26,0:33:50.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们怎么知道他们是否还活着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How do we know if they're still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.09,0:33:52.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备救援潜艇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Prep the rescue vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.18,0:33:57.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,潜艇一号 潜艇二号 收到请回答\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dive 1, Dive 2. Do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.43,0:33:59.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加油啊 乔纳斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, Jonas.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.02,0:34:03.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玫盈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Meiying.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.65,0:34:06.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玫盈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Meiying.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.52,0:34:09.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玫盈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Meiying.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.69,0:34:10.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生什么事了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.15,0:34:12.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们遭受重创\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Took a nasty hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.24,0:34:15.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,九溟舅舅呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uncle Jiuming?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.28,0:34:17.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,九溟舅舅在哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Where's Uncle Jiuming?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.03,0:34:19.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他在哪里  -我们联系不上他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Where is he? - We can't raise him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.58,0:34:23.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 我们依序解决每个问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. We work the problems one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.50,0:34:27.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先解决眼前的事 然后再应付下一件\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We do what's in front of us... and then we do the next thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.25,0:34:30.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会没事的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.05,0:34:32.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麦克\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mac!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.59,0:34:35.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救援潜艇无法运作\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The rescue sub isn't working.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.01,0:34:39.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,电池阵列被特意短路 看起来像是蓄意破坏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The battery array was deliberately shorted out. It looks like sabotage.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.84,0:34:40.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这怎么可能\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How's that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.84,0:34:43.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里不是管制区 还有30个工作人员\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This isn't a secure area. There are 30 people who work here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.60,0:34:44.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要多久才能修好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, how long to fix it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.81,0:34:47.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,控制板坏了 麦克 修不好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's the control boards, Mac. There is no fixing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.94,0:34:53.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-再试试 -我们情况如何\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Try it now. What's our status?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.86,0:34:54.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,通讯和温控都失灵\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No comms, no heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.11,0:34:57.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还在快速流失氧气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're losing air fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.99,0:34:58.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样行不通的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This isn't working.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.90,0:35:00.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把我额外储备的氧气也汇入\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Flood in my extra O2.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.99,0:35:03.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经汇入了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Already done.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.20,0:35:05.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还有最后一个办法\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've got one last idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.37,0:35:07.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将电路绕过温控系统\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Route the power through the heating cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.63,0:35:15.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,联系上潜艇一号了 麦克 联系上潜艇一号了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I got Dive 1. Mac, I got Dive 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.79,0:35:16.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乔纳斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jonas?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.96,0:35:19.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴听到你的声音 麦克\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good to hear your voice, Mac.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.34,0:35:21.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我更高兴听到你的 兄弟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not as good as it is to hear yours, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.01,0:35:23.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,情况如何\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.63,0:35:24.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很不妙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It ain't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.64,0:35:27.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几乎每个系统都失灵了 我们正快速流失氧气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Almost every system is down, and we're losing air fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.93,0:35:32.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会先换上紧急潜水机甲 但需要有人来接我们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We'll get into the emergency dive suits... and we're gonna need a ride up.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.64,0:35:36.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乔纳斯 这点我们目前做不到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jonas... it's not gonna be possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.36,0:35:39.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.94,0:35:43.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,电池阵列导致救援潜艇的控制板短路\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The battery array. It shorted out the control board in the rescue sub.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.82,0:35:45.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们目前正在调查\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're investigating it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.57,0:35:49.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乔纳斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jonas?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.87,0:35:51.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乔纳斯 你能听到吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jonas, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.79,0:35:55.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乔纳斯 我们无法去救你们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jonas, we can't get to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.04,0:36:00.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们就用走的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're gonna walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.17,0:36:05.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们回头穿越海沟 前往海底基地\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're gonna walk back across the trench. Make it into that sea floor station.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.92,0:36:09.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要进去 然后再回到海平面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And we're gonna get inside. And then we're gonna get to the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.34,0:36:11.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些潜水机甲顶多配备两小时氧气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Those suits have two hours of air tops.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.85,0:36:14.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,专为短暂的舱外工作设计\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They're only designed for brief extravehicular work.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.35,0:36:16.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会缓慢平稳地前进 没问题的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We'll go slow and steady. They'll hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.56,0:36:17.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,距离有三公里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's three kilometers.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.52,0:36:19.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在海底你们毫无防备\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You'll be defenseless out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.35,0:36:21.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麦克 不然你要我怎么办\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What do you want from me, Mac?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.19,0:36:24.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目前条件如此 所以只能这样做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is what we got, and this is what we're gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.24,0:36:28.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一半的组员已经死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Half our team is dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.15,0:36:30.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不要再失去另一半\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and I'm not losing the other half.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.58,0:36:38.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开始潜水机甲初始化\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Beginning suit initialization.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.12,0:36:40.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关节促动器运作正常\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joint actuators functioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.21,0:36:44.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超声波讯号通讯上线\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ultrasonic signal communications online.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.63,0:36:46.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,初始化完成\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Initialization complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.76,0:36:51.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要抛下潜艇一号了 麦克\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Abandoning Dive 1, Mac.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.88,0:36:55.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无线电通讯无法传回海平面 所以我们要断讯了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The radios won't relay to the surface, so we're going dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.10,0:36:57.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到基地后再跟你通话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Talk to you on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.10,0:36:59.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祝你们好运 乔纳斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Godspeed, Jonas.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.10,0:37:08.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紧急逃生系统启动\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Emergency escape initiated.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.96,0:37:33.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（海沟：深度两万五千呎）
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.98,0:37:54.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.40,0:37:57.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我差点杀了你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Almost killed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.45,0:37:59.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来这里干嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.65,0:38:00.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来拯救你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Saving your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.41,0:38:03.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后再走回那个基地\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And walking back to that station.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.78,0:38:05.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你是来干嘛的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.41,0:38:09.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先拯救你 然后再走回那个基地\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Saving your ass. And walking back to that station.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.50,0:38:12.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-时间不多了 -我们走吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Don't have much time. - Let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.79,0:38:15.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,舅\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jiu.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.71,0:38:18.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,舅 我以为你…\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uncle, I thought you--
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.96,0:38:21.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想甩了我 没那么容易\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're not going to get rid of me that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.97,0:38:26.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 喂 让我检查一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey. Let me check.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.14,0:38:27.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,氧气剩余…\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Air left...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.14,0:38:30.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得冷静下来 不然会缺氧的 兰斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, you need to calm down or you're gonna run out of oxygen, Lance.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.48,0:38:32.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我无法冷静\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't think i can.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.85,0:38:34.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把这想象成角色扮演\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Think of it as cosplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.69,0:38:38.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者在玩漆弹对战\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Or we could be paintballing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.19,0:38:39.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像是终极版的团建活动那样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Like the ultimate team-building exercise.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.15,0:38:42.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要在巨齿鲨 无暇顾及我们时尽快闪远\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We need to cover distance while the megs are still occupied.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.49,0:38:43.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,距离目的地三公里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Three kilometers to destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.69,0:38:46.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我赞成尽量远离巨齿鲨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Away from the megs is fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.57,0:38:48.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是个强大的团队\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're a strong group.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.32,0:38:49.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们做得到的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.99,0:38:53.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太神奇了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.79,0:38:56.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,由大自然免费提供的照明\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Lighting courtesy of Mother Nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.83,0:38:59.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太不可思议了 周围四处都是新物种\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's incredible, there are new species all around us.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.63,0:39:02.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 你们看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.71,0:39:04.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看这个 好漂亮\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look at this. It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.18,0:39:09.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好 我会发光的…\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello, my little biolum--
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.10,0:39:14.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快把蛇拿走 有一条蛇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's a snake! There's a snake!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.47,0:39:16.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把这个怪物从我头上拿下来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Get this monster off my head!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.48,0:39:22.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别再乱摸东西了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No touching stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.06,0:39:24.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是他先开始的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He started it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.61,0:39:28.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其余人员都撤离基地\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Everyone clear the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.94,0:39:30.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,DJ 乔纳斯出发多久了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}DJ, what's our time on Jonas?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.70,0:39:32.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,断讯后已过了41分钟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Forty-one minutes since they went dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.37,0:39:34.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们最快还要一小时才能走到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}At best, it'll take another hour for them to cover the distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.87,0:39:36.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.20,0:39:38.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们知道海沟里有某种非法活动\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We know there's some kind of rogue operation in the trench.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.83,0:39:41.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在还有混蛋插手这里的作业\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, some bastard's got his fingers in our operation here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.58,0:39:45.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那艘潜艇肯定是被破坏了 所以我们基地有内奸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That sub was definitely sabotaged, so we've got a mole on the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.21,0:39:47.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,DJ 我要你调出过去24小时内\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}DJ, I want you to pull all surveillance footage
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.63,0:39:49.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,舱区的所有监控画面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}from the sub bay for the last 24 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.96,0:39:53.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,洁丝 清查组员人事档案 寻找任何疑点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jess, run the personnel files on the crew, look for anything suspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.97,0:39:56.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓住这些混蛋 但同时小心自身安全\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're gonna get these sons of bitches, but we have to watch our own backs.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.10,0:40:00.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随时要有人留守指挥中心 懂吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}One of us mans the DCC at all times, understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.18,0:40:01.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.27,0:40:07.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是只有我这样想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is it just me,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.81,0:40:10.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是在海底健行三公里真的很累\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}or does walking three kilometers underwater sound like hard work?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.94,0:40:13.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这肯定不在我的愿望清单上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It certainly wasn't on my to-do list.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.03,0:40:18.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小章鱼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Baby octopi.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.62,0:40:21.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好多种颜色 真不可思议\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So many colors. That's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.54,0:40:26.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人想玩游戏吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Anybody wanna play a game?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.00,0:40:27.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,游戏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A game?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.00,0:40:29.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是游戏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This isn't a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.50,0:40:31.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她的意思是让我们别胡思乱想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She means to keep our minds occupied.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.09,0:40:34.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我已经在胡思乱想了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right now, my mind is pretty damn occupied.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.86,0:40:57.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这有只 有只 是…\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's a... there's a... It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.03,0:41:00.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兰斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Lance?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.40,0:41:01.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是什么东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.40,0:41:03.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我没看到 -兰斯在哪里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-  I didn't see. -  Where's Lance?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.08,0:41:05.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是巨齿鲨吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is it a meg?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.58,0:41:09.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他出事了 我很确定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Some... something's happened to him. I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.00,0:41:11.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兰斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Lance?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.71,0:41:16.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 不要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.59,0:41:18.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得继续前进\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We have to keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.84,0:41:20.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 我们不能把他留在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, we... We can't just leave him out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.09,0:41:22.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要找到他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We need to find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.51,0:41:23.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托 九溟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Please, Jiuming.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.93,0:41:24.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.76,0:41:26.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他已经死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.47,0:41:32.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,芮格斯 掩护我们后方 有任何动静立刻开枪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rigas, cover our six. Shoot anything that moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.48,0:41:36.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,包在我身上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You bet your ass I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.87,0:41:54.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,通讯系统上线\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Comms online.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.46,0:41:58.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生什么事了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.79,0:42:02.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛纳一号组员无意间发现我们基地\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The Mana One crew stumbled upon our station.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.59,0:42:04.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我炸了个坍塌把他们干掉了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I took them out with a landslide.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.46,0:42:06.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情真的太失控了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, this is... this is out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.84,0:42:11.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你授权我采取任何手段来保护行动\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You authorized me to do whatever's necessary to protect our operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.76,0:42:14.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.26,0:42:19.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们没死 现在正步行前往基地\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They're not dead. They are walking right now to the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.85,0:42:21.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若他们成功抵达\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If they get there,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.90,0:42:23.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就玩完了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}we are screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.15,0:42:28.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,取道山谷的话还剩一公里要走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's still a kilometer to go, straight through that valley,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.11,0:42:31.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且没有生物光来掩护我们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and we don't have the bioluminescence to cover us.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.36,0:42:33.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的行迹将完全暴露其中\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're going to be totally exposed out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.41,0:42:34.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们别无选择\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.49,0:42:36.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的氧气只够我们直线穿越\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We only have enough air to go straight through.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.91,0:42:40.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将照明亮度调低\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let's keep our lights on low spectrum.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.58,0:42:43.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 我们不想引来任何巨齿鲨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. We don't want to attract the megs.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.50,0:42:45.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,距离目的地一公里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}One kilometer to destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.96,0:42:47.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回报氧气剩余量\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}O2 check?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.96,0:42:49.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,65%\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}65%.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.59,0:42:50.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,50%\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}50.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.67,0:42:51.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,26%\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}26%.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.76,0:42:54.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这绝对不够\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not gonna be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.26,0:42:55.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着我 看着我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, look at me. Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.84,0:42:57.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着我 好吗 保持专注\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look at me, okay? Focus, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.18,0:43:00.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能做到 记住受训内容\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You can do this. Remember the training.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.31,0:43:03.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,声纳上有什么吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Anything on sonar?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.89,0:43:06.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我扫到一些东西 就在范围的边缘\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I got something, right at the edge of my range.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.40,0:43:08.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不断地进进出出\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Keeps going in and out.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.32,0:43:13.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们在跟踪我们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Stalking us.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.20,0:43:23.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迫近警报\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Proximity alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.71,0:43:26.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是什么东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.63,0:43:33.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是一群鱼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's just a shoal of fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.59,0:43:36.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家保持冷静\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Stay calm, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.13,0:43:38.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你还好吗  -还好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Are you okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.88,0:43:39.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续前进\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.01,0:43:43.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 麦克\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ayo, Mac.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.01,0:43:46.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,监控画面半点不剩 内容都被删除了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We got jack on the security footage. Somebody deleted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.02,0:43:47.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,舱区的画面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}For the sub bay?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.02,0:43:49.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整个该死的基地都被删了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}For the whole damn station.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.98,0:43:51.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们很缜密 但并非无所不知\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They're good, but they don't know everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.65,0:43:53.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还会将加密备份上链卫星\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's a satellite uplink with an encrypted backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.77,0:43:56.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要去伺服器室 看看能否下载\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm gonna go to the server room, see if I can pull it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.57,0:43:57.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过多久了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Time?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.69,0:43:59.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,1小时50分 他们很快就要没氧气了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}One hour, 50. They'll be out of air soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.61,0:44:01.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我正在扫描所有频道 但还没音讯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm scanning all channels, but nothing yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.74,0:44:09.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快到了 大约还剩四百米\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's it. Maybe 400 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.09,0:44:17.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警告 进入备用氧气量\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Warning. Entering oxygen reserves.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.80,0:44:18.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做得到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.38,0:44:21.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好吗  -好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Yeah? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.63,0:44:22.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得到读数\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm getting a reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.38,0:44:25.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们右边有很多动静\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Many contacts to our right.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.34,0:44:27.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并快速迫近\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Coming in fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.39,0:44:31.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么 是巨齿鲨吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What, megs?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.14,0:44:35.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 更小也更快\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. Smaller. Faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.77,0:44:41.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家立刻前往基地 快点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Everybody make it to the station! Go, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.52,0:44:43.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-警告 氧气剩余量低 -加油\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Warning. Oxygen level low. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.44,0:44:44.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-快点 -我要没气了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Come on. - I'm out of air.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.24,0:44:47.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们正在越过海脊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They're coming over the ridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.20,0:44:53.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are those things?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.66,0:44:54.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太远了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.91,0:44:56.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得采举防御行动\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We need to make a stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.96,0:44:57.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,转身迎战\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Turn and fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.26,0:45:13.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚开\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.39,0:45:19.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-玫盈 -救命 射它们的头\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Meiying! - Help! Shoot their head!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.98,0:45:21.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-玫盈 -舅舅\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Meiying! - Uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.77,0:45:25.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我抓住你了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.82,0:45:26.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓紧我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.82,0:45:28.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们正在咬穿潜水机甲\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They're biting through the suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.78,0:45:32.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玫盈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Meiying!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.71,0:45:43.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 不要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.92,0:45:45.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坚持住 寇蒂斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hold on, Curtis!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.33,0:45:47.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太多只了 我们毫无胜算\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Too many! We don't have a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.27,0:46:07.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家退后\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Everybody stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.36,0:46:10.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续前进\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.24,0:46:19.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,九溟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jiuming!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.53,0:46:20.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别无选择了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.20,0:46:23.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的很想死 是吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You really want to die, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.81,0:46:50.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得赶快进入气闸舱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Gotta make it to the airlock!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.82,0:47:04.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警告 低氧量\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Warning. Low air.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.12,0:47:07.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-没用的 我只会拖累你 -低氧量\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- It's no use I'm holding you back. - Low air.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.08,0:47:14.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就快到了 你能做到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- It's not too far. - You can make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.37,0:47:15.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警告 低氧量\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Warning. Low air.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.38,0:47:19.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警告 低氧量\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Warning. Low air.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.88,0:47:23.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,氧气耗尽\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Air depleted.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.27,0:47:34.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,舅舅\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.06,0:47:36.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,面罩即将失效\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Visor failure imminent.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.31,0:47:39.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,九溟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jiuming!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.03,0:47:48.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 我们得前进 我们别无选择\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. We gotta go. We don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.61,0:47:49.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它绕回来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's coming back around!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.07,0:47:51.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-老天 -进去 进去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-  Oh, God! -  Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.75,0:47:56.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得越权控制\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We have to do the override.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.67,0:47:59.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加油 快点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.33,0:48:01.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,芮格斯 加油\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rigas, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.09,0:48:04.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做得到 快进来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You can do it. Get in!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.38,0:48:08.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关上门\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Shut the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.30,0:48:10.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,寇蒂斯 没事的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Curtis, you'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.59,0:48:11.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,机甲即将内爆\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Suit implosion imminent.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.05,0:48:13.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-快好了 快好了 -老天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Almost there. Almost there! - Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.35,0:48:17.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要内爆了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's gonna implode.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.64,0:48:18.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快给舱房减压\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Depressurize the room!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.43,0:48:20.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 不要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.77,0:48:21.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-内爆 -不要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- No!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.48,0:49:05.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.31,0:49:07.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我讨厌那些鬼东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I hate these things!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.52,0:49:10.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 芮格斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Rigas.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.32,0:49:12.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽快收拾好心情\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let's try to keep it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.65,0:49:16.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们尚未脱离困境\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We ain't out of the woods yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.35,0:49:45.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,芮格斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rigas.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.53,0:49:59.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人都上哪去了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Where is everybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.08,0:50:16.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么味道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What is that smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.13,0:50:19.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,潜水员\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Divers.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.01,0:50:29.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人在家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nobody home.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.52,0:50:31.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来负责守门\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll cover the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.06,0:50:41.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,运行这基地的人是敌非友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whoever's running this is not our friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.03,0:50:44.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要尽快联系玛纳一号 你做得到吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We need to contact Mana One ASAP. Think you can handle it?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.74,0:50:45.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以 当然可以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.53,0:50:51.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们到底在开采什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What is this that they're mining?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.74,0:50:55.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管是什么 他们都用这些容器运到海平面上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whatever it is, they're sending it up to the surface with these pods.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.63,0:51:04.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,稀土金属\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mmm. Rare earth metals.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.92,0:51:09.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被用于超导体 航太工程与量子计算\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They're used in superconductors, aerospace and quantum computing.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.43,0:51:12.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,光这一箱可能就价值十亿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This box alone could be a billion dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.14,0:51:15.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,十亿美元吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Billion" with a "B?"
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.81,0:51:16.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.81,0:51:17.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛纳一号\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Mana One.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.06,0:51:19.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乔纳斯 通讯上线了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jonas. Comms are live.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.36,0:51:25.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请回话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.86,0:51:27.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是乔纳斯 听得到吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's Jonas. Getting this?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.53,0:51:28.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊 你还活着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.86,0:51:30.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们情况如何\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's your status?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.20,0:51:33.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们失去了兰斯 莎尔和寇蒂斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We lost Lance, Sal, and Curtis.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.82,0:51:36.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在抵达海底基地\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're at the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.24,0:51:38.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是一个非法采矿作业\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's a rogue mining operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.83,0:51:40.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下面有人吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is there anyone down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.29,0:51:41.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目前为止我们还没看到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not that we've seen so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.17,0:51:43.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们已经渗透了玛纳一号\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They've infiltrated Mana One.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.62,0:51:45.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救援潜艇遭到破坏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The rescue sub was sabotaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.67,0:51:48.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是谁做的  -我们正在调查 但先听我说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- By who? - We're working on it. But check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.05,0:51:52.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚才在检视先前扫描基地的影片\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was going over the video of when you went over that station before.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.97,0:51:54.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们看北边\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look at the north side.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.09,0:51:59.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来像紧急逃生舱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Looks like emergency escape pods.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.81,0:52:02.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我们现在位置的另一端\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's the opposite side from where we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.82,0:52:19.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里感觉死气沉沉的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Feels dead in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.57,0:52:20.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟紧点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Stay close.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.74,0:52:25.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些是我设计的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}These are my designs.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.37,0:52:27.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们怎么会有这个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How do they have this?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.05,0:52:41.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来就是这里了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Looks like this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.65,0:52:53.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,数到三\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}On three.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.86,0:52:54.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.78,0:53:00.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-再试一次 -没用的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-  Again. - It's not gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.62,0:53:13.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们先请\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.29,0:53:18.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这才像话嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ah, this is more like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.30,0:53:21.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点打开个逃生舱然后闪人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let's crack open a pod and get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.72,0:53:24.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里什么都没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nothing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.47,0:53:27.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些控制板都失灵了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}These controls ain't working.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.43,0:53:28.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得先关闭舱门\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We need to close the hatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.76,0:53:29.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}On it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.39,0:53:36.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各位 不是我关的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Guys, that wasn't me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.81,0:53:42.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乔纳斯 既然你来了 我们就摊开来谈吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jonas, now that I have you here, we need to talk candidly.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.11,0:53:46.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已完全掌控基地 并锁死这舱房\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I have full control of the station, and I've locked down this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.24,0:53:47.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,洁丝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jess?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.32,0:53:48.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的性命掌握在我手中\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Your life is in my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.99,0:53:50.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在干嘛 洁丝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing, Jess?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.45,0:53:53.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些人是你的朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}These are your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.87,0:53:56.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们一起共事好多年了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They've been with you for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.71,0:53:57.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道事实很伤人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know it hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.33,0:54:01.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之所以跟你谈 是因为希望我们能站在同一边\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And we're talking because I'd prefer we were on the same side.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.25,0:54:03.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是所有人都赚那么多钱 就没意思了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All making so much money, it ceases to have meaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.75,0:54:05.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想用钱收买我们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're offering us money?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.80,0:54:09.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的三个朋友都被你害死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Three of our friends are dead because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.13,0:54:12.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我会忘记这点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You think I'm gonna forget about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.72,0:54:18.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不不不 那是第一个逃生舱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, no, no, no! That's the first escape pod!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.48,0:54:19.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.94,0:54:23.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,芮格斯 芮格斯 你可以救下玫盈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rigas? Rigas, you can save Meiying.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.02,0:54:27.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿起那把鱼枪 往乔纳斯的心脏射\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Take that speargun and shoot Jonas in the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.50,0:54:50.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别开枪打他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't shoot him.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.10,0:55:04.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.81,0:55:05.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.23,0:55:10.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有这样才能让玫盈活下去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's the only way Meiying survives.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.32,0:55:15.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.70,0:55:18.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,芮格斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rigas!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.20,0:55:21.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开枪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.45,0:55:26.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-开枪 -不 对不起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Do it! - No. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.46,0:55:29.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 我做不到 我做不到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry. I'm sorry, I can't. I can't. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.92,0:55:39.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是最后一个逃生舱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That was the last pod.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.80,0:55:43.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就跟你说那招行不通\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I told you that wouldn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.01,0:55:45.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我跟他们谈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Put me on.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.56,0:55:50.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉 不得不走到这一步\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, sorry it had to come to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.31,0:55:52.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以…\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.73,0:55:54.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会在一周内恢复开采\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}we'll be back at work in a week,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.36,0:55:58.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,使用你们的技术 来获取任何我们想要的东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}using your technology to take whatever we want.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.19,0:56:01.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的研究所将成为我们的跳板\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Your institute'll be a platform that we use
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.74,0:56:05.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在未来数十年继续掠夺海洋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}to plunder the ocean for decades.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.28,0:56:06.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会有报应的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Karma will get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.45,0:56:08.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少跟我抱怨什么生态系统\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And before you start whining about the ecosystem,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.91,0:56:11.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼才在乎 我们将获利数十亿美元\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}who cares? We'll make billions.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.41,0:56:13.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且没人会看到我们造成的破坏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And no one is going to see the damage we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.75,0:56:14.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你闭嘴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.63,0:56:20.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,洁丝 我已派遣善后小组前往玛纳一号\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jess, I've already dispatched a clean-up crew to Mana One.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.84,0:56:21.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,了结此事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Finish this.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.84,0:56:23.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（洪氾区）
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.59,0:56:27.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要如何打开门\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How do we open the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.30,0:56:31.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若能切断与海平面的通讯讯号\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If we could cut the comm link to the surface...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.72,0:56:33.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她就无法操纵一切\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}she couldn't control anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.73,0:56:36.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但那在之前第一个舱房 而且我们无法打开这扇门\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But it's back in the first room, and there's no getting through this door.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.48,0:56:38.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个气闸舱仍然能开启\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This airlock still works!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.52,0:56:41.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为何要穿越气闸舱 已没有逃生舱了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why would you go through the airlock? There's no pod.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.77,0:56:45.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会游到当初进来的气闸舱 并进行越权控制\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll swim to the airlock where we came in and do the override.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.32,0:56:47.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没有潜水机甲 这怎么能行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You have no suit. How could it work?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.45,0:56:50.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水在压力下不会压缩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Water doesn't compress under pressure,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.49,0:56:52.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以若他能强迫海水进入鼻窦腔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}so if he can force water in his sinus cavities,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.62,0:56:56.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那他在昏倒之前 或许可以存活30到60秒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}he could survive 30, maybe 60 seconds before he passes out.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.58,0:56:57.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是有可能做到的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- It is possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.17,0:57:02.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们依序解决每个问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We work the problems one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.71,0:57:06.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先解决眼前的事 然后再应付下一件\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We do what's in front of us, then we do the next thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.85,0:57:16.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若有任何人能完成这件事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If anyone can do this,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.10,0:57:18.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那肯定是你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.91,0:57:37.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不会被压力挤扁吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Won't he be crushed by the pressure?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.45,0:57:39.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情不是那样的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It doesn't work like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.33,0:57:42.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水里的鱼也没穿金属机甲 对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You don't see fish wearing metal suits, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.00,0:57:46.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,重点在于空气 它在压力下做出反应\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's about air. It reacts under pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.08,0:57:49.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以他才必须把空气从鼻窦中排出来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And that's why he has to blow it out of his sinuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.43,0:58:51.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 环保狂人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey there, tree hugger.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.32,0:58:58.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乔纳斯泰勒 生态战士\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jonas Taylor, eco-warrior,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.28,0:59:00.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为崇高的使命而战\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}fighting the good fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.40,0:59:02.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果你猜怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.45,0:59:03.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你输了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.28,0:59:11.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在马尼拉监狱蹲了两年\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I spent two years in a Manila prison
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.00,0:59:16.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你和你的生态怪咖同伙 害我们的船被扣押\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}after you and your eco-freak buddies had our ship seized.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.75,0:59:20.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我每天都在想你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I thought about you every single day.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.88,0:59:24.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你甚至不记得我了 对吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You don't even remember me, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.18,0:59:27.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没印象\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.64,0:59:28.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蒙提斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Montes.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.01,0:59:32.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这世上有数百万个混帐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's a million scumbags in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.73,0:59:37.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很难记得每一个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's hard to keep track of all of 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.45,0:59:55.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不行了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't think I can make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.79,0:59:57.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓紧 抓紧 没事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You can do it. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.42,1:00:47.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're going to die!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.58,1:00:48.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事 没事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's ok, it's ok.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.72,1:01:01.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（主锁越权控制）
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.02,1:01:12.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（确认越权控制 确认）
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.64,1:01:47.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玫盈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Meiying!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.56,1:01:49.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玫盈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Meiying!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.74,1:02:10.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,善后小组即将抵达玛纳一号\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Clean up crew approaching Mana One.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.87,1:02:12.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总算到了 我们处于警戒状态\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}About time. We are on alert.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.00,1:02:15.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,员工们都被监禁在自己寝室里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Everyone confined to their quarters.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.75,1:02:19.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要全面控制玛纳一号 并解决任何威胁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We need to get control of Mana One and dispose of any liabilities.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.09,1:02:26.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生了什么紧急情况\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's the emergency?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.18,1:02:27.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我找到了监控备份\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I got into the security backup.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.18,1:02:29.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看这个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.22,1:02:32.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是洁丝破坏了救援潜艇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jess disabled the rescue sub.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.23,1:02:36.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-什么  -你看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- What? - Watch.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.52,1:02:39.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她看起来像在修理 对吧  但不是 等着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Like she could be repairing it, right? But no, wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.82,1:02:45.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是蒙提斯的潜艇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's Montes' sub.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.24,1:02:46.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要开着它离开\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's our ride out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.74,1:02:56.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,液压装置外泄\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's a leak in the hydraulics.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.24,1:02:57.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,掠食者防御系统也失灵了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Predator countermeasures are down.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.54,1:02:59.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们绝对无法逃离巨齿鲨的包抄\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We'll never make it past the megs.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.04,1:03:01.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要障眼法\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We need a distraction.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.63,1:03:05.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,点亮基地 巨齿鲨会转而攻击它\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Light up the station. The megs will attack it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.25,1:03:06.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 然后一并杀死我们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. And kill us.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.63,1:03:08.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们够快就不会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not if we're fast enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.34,1:03:10.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,九溟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jiuming!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.35,1:03:19.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-喂 芮格斯 -是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-  Hey, Rigas. - Yep?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.77,1:03:21.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那一刻 我还以为你会杀了我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}For a moment, I thought you were gonna kill me back there.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.27,1:03:24.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为她要求我朝你的心脏开枪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, she did say to shoot you in the heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.61,1:03:26.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我很清楚你没有心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I know for a fact you ain't got one of those.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.07,1:03:33.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你俩再慢点吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you for working.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.38,1:03:48.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得关上舱门 乔纳斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Gotta close the hatch, Jonas.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.01,1:03:54.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然我们都会死\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're all gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.88,1:03:56.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会回来的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.05,1:03:57.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 他不会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, he's not.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.22,1:04:03.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他会成功的 -不 我们必须关闭舱门\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- He's gonna make it. - No! We have to close the hatch!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.19,1:04:10.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关门 乔纳斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Close it! Jonas!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.66,1:04:20.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我回来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.74,1:04:24.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's him!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.63,1:04:36.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才真惊险\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That was close.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.34,1:04:39.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太惊险了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Too close.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.80,1:04:43.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该关上舱门的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You should have shut the hatch.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.39,1:04:46.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 但玫盈会杀了我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Meiying would have killed me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.06,1:04:51.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你有考虑过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You thought about it, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.06,1:04:53.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 我们有考虑过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. We thought about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.23,1:04:55.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对吧 芮格斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Didn't we, Rigas?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.98,1:04:57.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你闭嘴吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.19,1:04:59.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有一点点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.28,1:05:01.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孙子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Very funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.20,1:05:11.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,炸药\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Explosives?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.04,1:05:13.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看这个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.29,1:05:15.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看还有什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look what else.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.47,1:05:30.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那会造成问题吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is that gonna be a problem?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.43,1:05:32.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是温跃层上的破口\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's a hole in the thermal layer.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.51,1:05:35.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定是采矿爆炸时造成的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It must have been caused by the mining explosions.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.81,1:05:37.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最终会自动闭合\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It will seal up eventually.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.98,1:05:38.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最终\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Eventually?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.69,1:05:41.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 在一个小时内\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Within an hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.57,1:05:44.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巨齿鲨能跟着我们穿过去吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can the megs follow us through?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.07,1:05:46.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望不能\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I hope not.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.72,1:06:14.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,男士们 我不想伤害你们 但我需要你们出来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Boys, I don't want to harm you, but I do need you to come out of this room.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.72,1:06:16.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是洁丝 她带了三个士兵\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's Jess. She's got three soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.10,1:06:19.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 该动手了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. It's go time.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.60,1:06:21.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿着这个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Take this.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.89,1:06:23.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-什么鬼东西  -这是电击棒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- The hell is this? - It's a Taser.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.15,1:06:24.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开门\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Open up.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.69,1:06:27.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们试图杀掉乔纳斯 肯定也会杀了我们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They tried to kill Jonas, they're definitely gonna kill us.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.98,1:06:29.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 听着 计画如下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, listen. Here's the plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.53,1:06:32.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,数到三后 你把门打开 我会朝他们喷防狼喷雾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}On the count of three, you'll open the door and I'mma pepper spray 'em.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.78,1:06:34.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后你关门 稍待片刻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right, and you'll shut the door and you're gonna wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.61,1:06:36.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再出去使用电击棒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Then go out there and use the Taser.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.45,1:06:37.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一 二 三\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.12,1:06:41.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 麦克 不要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, Mac, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.16,1:06:43.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 麦克…\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, Mac...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.96,1:06:46.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛 好痛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It burns! It burns!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.83,1:06:47.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.29,1:06:49.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,睡觉时间到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sleepy time.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.52,1:07:05.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.68,1:07:07.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（一号监控器）
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.56,1:07:10.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麻烦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.74,1:07:21.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样信心满满地乱闯是很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, we're walking fast and with a lot of determination, which is great.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.08,1:07:23.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们的计画到底是什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But what exactly is the plan here?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.28,1:07:25.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们有武器 而我们没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They're armed and we're not.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.04,1:07:32.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 那你想干嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All righty. So what are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.75,1:07:34.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你又想干嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.84,1:07:37.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和我去找麦克和DJ\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You and I find Mac and DJ.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.46,1:07:40.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,芮格斯 尽量收集物资 再找一艘救生船 我们才能离开\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rigas, grab what you can. Secure a Zodiac so we can get off this thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.93,1:07:41.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太赞了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rock and roll.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.93,1:07:43.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玫盈跟着你比较安全\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Safest if Meiying goes with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.77,1:07:53.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会用生命来保护她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll protect her with my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.94,1:07:55.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也会用生命保护她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I'll protect her with mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.90,1:07:56.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.90,1:07:57.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.32,1:07:59.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.28,1:08:01.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.71,1:08:15.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都跟你说了要等一下再出门\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I told you to wait before you went out that door.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.92,1:08:17.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-眼睛还好吗  -眼睛爆痛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- How's your eyes? - My eye stings.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.75,1:08:20.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们能爬上通讯阵列\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If we climb up to the communications array,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.88,1:08:22.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就能绕过指挥中心 打电话求助\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}we can bypass the DCC and we can call for help.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.13,1:08:24.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们该怎么说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are we supposed to say?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.30,1:08:26.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐怖攻击事件\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh... terrorist action?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.68,1:08:28.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-对 很好 恐攻事件 -对 恐攻事件\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Yeah, good. Terrorist action. - Yeah, terrorist action.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.14,1:08:30.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好吧 -你有更好的主意吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-  Okay. - You got a better idea?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.51,1:08:31.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不准动\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-  Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.31,1:08:33.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.94,1:08:44.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,DJ DJ\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}DJ! DJ!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.53,1:08:47.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.70,1:08:50.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这样 宝贝 看我多厉害\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow! Yeah, baby! Get some!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.91,1:08:52.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-喂 -跑 麦克 快跑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Hey. - Run, Mac! Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.37,1:08:54.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点 快点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.17,1:09:08.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散开 找到他们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Spread out! Find 'em.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.09,1:09:14.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你携带电击棒 现在还会游泳\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You got Tasers? Now you can swim?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.10,1:09:17.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,突然间 你就像蝙蝠侠一样到处乱窜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All of a sudden you run around like you're frickin' Batman.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.01,1:09:19.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hell yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.31,1:09:23.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上次之后 你们都求我回来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}After last time, y'all begged me to come back.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.73,1:09:26.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,“DJ 我们是一家人 DJ”\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"DJ, oh, we family, DJ."
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.86,1:09:30.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,“DJ 我们需要你” 好 好事 我答应 但我并不傻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"DJ, we need you." Yeah, all right. Bet. But I ain't stupid.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.82,1:09:33.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我开始锻炼 学会如何战斗跟游泳\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I trained up, I learned how to fight, I learned how to swim,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.57,1:09:35.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且出门一定要带上我的求生包\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and I will never go anywhere without my survival pack.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.03,1:09:37.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-求生包  -对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Survival pack? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.62,1:09:38.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你瞧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.37,1:09:40.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 宝贝 过来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mmm-hmm. Come here, baby. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.12,1:09:42.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,砰\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Bam.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.62,1:09:46.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 我甚至像电影《大白鲨2》那样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I even made poison-tipped bullets,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.42,1:09:47.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,制作了带毒子弹\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}just like Jaws 2.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.13,1:09:53.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 DJ 我们走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, DJ! Let's go, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.47,1:09:58.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这太扯了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is insane.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.14,1:10:03.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不准动 混蛋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Freeze, assholes.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.60,1:10:07.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 不准动\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, freeze.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.81,1:10:08.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能搞定吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You got this?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.86,1:10:14.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才真是不走运\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That was some unfortunate shit back there.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.65,1:10:17.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要 拜托 别开枪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, please! Don't shoot!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.41,1:10:21.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你们在找我和乔纳斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know you're looking for me and Jonas.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.99,1:10:23.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我相信你们听不懂中文\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I also know you don't speak Chinese,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.41,1:10:26.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说那么多中文因为你们听不懂 为了吸引你们的注意力\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but I'm speaking it to distract you guys,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.37,1:10:28.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我的朋友们要背后袭击你们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}because my friend is about to attack you from behind.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.91,1:10:29.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.67,1:10:37.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蠢蛋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}sucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.92,1:10:42.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为你死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I thought you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.14,1:10:44.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想得美 麦克\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wishful thinking, Mac.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.72,1:10:47.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来是鼻中膈弯曲先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If it ain't the deviated septum.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.26,1:10:48.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有船正在离开\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Boat's leaving.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.10,1:10:53.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目前情况如何\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's our status?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.23,1:10:56.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,B小队正在赶过来 预计10分钟后抵达\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Bravo team are inbound. ETA, ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.31,1:10:57.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.07,1:11:00.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来这里做什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.03,1:11:09.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你还好吗  -还好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Are you okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.95,1:11:12.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乔纳斯在玛纳一号上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jonas is on Mana One.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.25,1:11:15.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在需要封锁此处\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We need to lock this place down now.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.21,1:11:19.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全面搜查基地\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Search the station top to bottom.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.09,1:11:22.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将基地员工关在寝室 其余的格杀勿论\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Secure personnel in their quarters, kill anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.42,1:11:25.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快去 去啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.68,1:11:33.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.81,1:11:43.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各位 我们有大麻烦了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, guys? We've got a big problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.86,1:11:54.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们追踪到三只 在破口关闭前逃脱的巨齿鲨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We tracked three megs that escaped before the breach closed.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.49,1:11:57.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要为此准备好一个说辞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're gonna need a good cover story for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.20,1:11:58.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那应该不难\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, that shouldn't be hard.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.66,1:12:00.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都知道 乔纳斯和九溟有多胆大妄为\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Everyone knows Jonas and Jiuming were reckless.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.08,1:12:03.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 我们需要一个英雄\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, we need a hero.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.21,1:12:07.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从这场意外的悲剧中挺身而出\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Like, someone to emerge from this unforeseeable tragedy,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.21,1:12:10.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,担起领导研究所的位置\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}who can step into a leadership position at the Institute.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.76,1:12:13.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,洁丝 你准备好要升职了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jess, are you ready for promotion?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.43,1:12:16.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很感谢你的信任\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I appreciate your confidence.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.76,1:12:17.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,洁丝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jess!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.01,1:12:20.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它是从温跃层破口逃出来的 但你大可放心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's from the thermocline breach. But you can relax.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.64,1:12:22.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这地方百分百防鲨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This place? Meg-proof.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.27,1:12:24.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乔纳斯原本一直很担心这点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, Jonas was always afraid of this,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.98,1:12:27.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我认为只要有追踪器 和武装直升机 就能轻松解决\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but I think, between trackers and gunships, we can solve the problem
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.19,1:12:30.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并凭藉高超的公关技巧扭转舆论\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and come out the other side with a significant positive PR spin.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.44,1:12:32.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 我已经着手进行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.53,1:12:33.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也在考虑…\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was also thinking...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.51,1:13:00.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在怎么办\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What now?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.76,1:13:02.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是唯一的出路 我们必须接受\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's our only way off. We have to take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.02,1:13:05.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但那艘船不足以载我们返回大陆\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But that thing doesn't have the range to get us to the mainland.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.60,1:13:09.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你担心上不了岸 那前一百码呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're worried about the destination? What about the first hundred yards?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.10,1:13:11.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们估计到时就挂点了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's where we goin' die.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.82,1:13:13.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们慢慢划船\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We paddle out slow.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.32,1:13:15.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不开引擎 维持最小动静\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No engines. Minimal motion.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.69,1:13:16.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就不会看起来像食物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We won't look like food.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.11,1:13:19.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等我们划远后 再放手一搏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When we're clear, we make a run for it. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.45,1:13:20.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们开始吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.37,1:13:24.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我仍然认为我们看起来像食物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I still think we look like food.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.45,1:13:26.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家安静\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Shh. Quiet, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.91,1:13:28.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢慢划桨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Paddle slowly.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.62,1:13:30.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这感觉令人不快地熟悉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This feels unpleasantly familiar.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.04,1:13:33.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望结果会比上次好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just hope it goes better than last time.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.08,1:13:35.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上次怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What happened last time?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.96,1:13:37.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会想知道的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You don't wanna know.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.59,1:13:44.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here he comes.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.39,1:13:52.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点 快点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.40,1:13:55.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千万别让他们活着回来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let's not bring 'em back alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.65,1:13:59.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道怎么开这东西 对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You do know how to drive this thing, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.53,1:14:08.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,熄火 立刻关掉引擎\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Stop! Stop the engine right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.37,1:14:11.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然会吸引巨齿鲨过来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Or you will attract the megs.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.45,1:14:16.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的 不要动\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Be still.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.83,1:14:18.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要有任何动作\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- No motion whatsoever.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.67,1:14:25.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我锁定他们了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I have the shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.47,1:14:27.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开枪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.63,1:14:28.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-趴下 -快点 执行任务\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Get down! -  Mate, do your job.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.84,1:14:30.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-快开枪 -没那么容易\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Take the bloody shot. - It's not easy as it looks.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.31,1:14:36.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它杀了他们 它吃掉了他们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He got 'em! He ate 'em!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.10,1:14:38.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它吃掉整条船\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He ate the whole boat!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.52,1:14:42.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生什么事了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.44,1:14:44.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,洁丝死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jess is dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.73,1:14:47.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-什么  -我们控制住玛纳一号\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- What? - We stabilized Mana One
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.32,1:14:49.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但泰勒和张逃脱了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but Taylor and Zhang have escaped.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.70,1:14:50.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你希望我怎么做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.91,1:14:52.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞定一切 杀了他们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fix it! Kill them!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.49,1:14:54.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要能做到 条件任你开\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You do this, you write your own ticket.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.66,1:14:55.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保证你一生富贵\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You are set for life.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.79,1:14:57.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.25,1:15:01.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们只可能逃往几个地方\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's only a couple places they could make it to.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.58,1:15:03.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在哭吗 蒙提斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Are you crying, Montes? -
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.04,1:15:07.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（小心炸药）
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.18,1:15:17.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有巨齿鲨的踪迹吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Any sign of the megs?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.39,1:15:19.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Negative.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.06,1:15:22.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这东西绝对行不通的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's no way this thing's gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.94,1:15:23.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它会行得通\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.65,1:15:27.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你炸死自己的机会 都比炸死巨齿鲨还高\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Bloke, you got more chance of blowing up yourself than one of the megs.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.65,1:15:30.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少我不会被吃掉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}At least I won't get eaten.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.73,1:15:31.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说得对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ha, I hear that.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.07,1:15:34.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乔纳斯 能帮我做一支吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jo, can you make me one?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.82,1:15:37.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,包在我身上 麦克\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I got you covered, Mac.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.87,1:15:39.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须想办法警告群众\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We have to find a way to warn people.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.12,1:15:42.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以防巨齿鲨向岸边移动\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}In case the megs move towards land.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.37,1:15:45.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在东南方60公里处有一个岛屿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's an island 60 klicks southeast of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.17,1:15:47.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它被列为有人居住\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's listed as inhabited.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.21,1:15:49.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有谁居住\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Inhabited by who?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.96,1:15:52.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,岛名翻译起来差不多是…\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The name more or less translates to...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.17,1:15:54.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢乐岛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fun Island.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.34,1:15:56.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢乐岛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fun Island?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.63,1:15:59.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（欢乐岛）
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.39,1:16:03.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好耶\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.56,1:16:12.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎来到欢乐岛 我们的度假村应有尽有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Welcome to Fun Island. Our resort has everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.94,1:16:15.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,餐厅 超美味\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The restaurant, amazing.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.73,1:16:17.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪斯可舞厅 棒极了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The disco, incredible.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.11,1:16:19.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有我们的水疗中心 舒适无比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And our spa, to die for.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.70,1:16:21.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}OMG.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.87,1:16:24.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们的招牌菜 海鲜惊喜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's our special dish. Seafood Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.45,1:16:26.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊 我真不知要从哪开始\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow! I wouldn't know where to start.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.91,1:16:28.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 千万不要错过烤鲨鱼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, just don't miss out on the grilled shark.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.08,1:16:30.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,皮聘 皮聘\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pippin! Pippin!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.75,1:16:31.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,皮聘\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pippin!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.75,1:16:33.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-妈啊 那是什么  -皮聘\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Whoa, what is that? -  Pippin!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.96,1:16:35.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们在逃离什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are they running from?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.76,1:16:40.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是菜鸟吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Your first time at the rodeo?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.51,1:16:44.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在你出生前我就跟你爸合作\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I worked with your dad since before you were born.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.60,1:16:45.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他没给过我这种气受\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I never had this kind of trouble from him.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.97,1:16:47.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能不能把手机放下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can you put your phone down?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.10,1:16:50.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好不容易出来一回 这憋多久了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}After all these hard years we're finally on vacation,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.64,1:16:52.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能不能爽一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}savor the moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.14,1:16:54.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 我也会对他大吼大叫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, and I yelled at him too.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.06,1:16:58.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚五分钟 就四百多个赞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've already got 400 likes.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.40,1:16:59.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的妈呀
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.44,1:17:02.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我身处天堂 你却要毁了一切\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sitting in paradise and you are ruining it!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.86,1:17:05.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁会干这种事 毁了别人的天堂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who does that? Who... ruins paradise for other people?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.91,1:17:10.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 宝贝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.62,1:17:12.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想帮我在背上抹点油吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wanna rub some oil on my back?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.37,1:17:14.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.00,1:17:16.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那前面呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How 'bout my front?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.67,1:17:17.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ew.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.17,1:17:23.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（距欢乐岛5公里 距温跃层破口70公里）
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.42,1:17:24.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come over.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.22,1:17:26.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么呀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.01,1:17:31.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在干嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.64,1:17:38.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑶瑶\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yaoyao...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.69,1:17:42.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愿意嫁给我吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Will you marry me?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.82,1:17:49.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快去找戒指啊 笨蛋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Find it, idiot!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.03,1:17:50.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你等会啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.12,1:17:54.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到了没\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Have you found it?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.83,1:17:59.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.25,1:18:04.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑶瑶\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yaoyao.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.63,1:18:06.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑶瑶\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yaoyao.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.63,1:18:09.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑶瑶 瑶瑶\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yaoyao! Yaoyao!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.75,1:18:43.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那看起来不太妙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This doesn't look good.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.08,1:18:46.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,芮格斯 快载我们过去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rigas, get us there fast!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.92,1:18:55.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,切断手机上链讯号\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Kill the cell phone uplink.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.10,1:19:08.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们公关的好机会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's a lot of exposure for us on this.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.81,1:19:10.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽快解决乔纳斯和他的队员\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Take care of Jonas and his team quickly,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.10,1:19:12.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别闹出动静\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and quietly.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.11,1:19:16.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家快上岸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Everybody out of the water!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.73,1:19:18.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-鲨鱼 有鲨鱼 -回到海滩上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-  Shark! Shark! -  Get back on the beach!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.11,1:19:21.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快上岸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Get out of the water!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.66,1:19:22.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家快回海滩上…\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Get back on the beach, every...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.16,1:19:27.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,电信通讯已截断 结束\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mobile comms are down. Over.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.16,1:20:14.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计们 收到了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You copy, guys?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.71,1:20:16.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鳄鱼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.29,1:20:19.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么鬼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.75,1:20:21.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-快点 快点 -回到直升机上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-  Move, move! - Get into the chopper.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.29,1:20:23.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,立刻送她去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now! Go with her!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.06,1:20:39.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家快上岸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Everybody out!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.15,1:20:41.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-鲨鱼 -鲨鱼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Shark! Shark!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.44,1:20:43.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回去 不要下水\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Go back! - Don't go into the water!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.11,1:20:45.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水里有鲨鱼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's a shark!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.82,1:20:48.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快上海滩 回去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Get on the beach! Go back!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.36,1:20:49.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须去拯救他们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We have to save them.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.82,1:20:51.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我不会丢下你一人 -手机没讯号了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- I'm not leaving ya. - Cell phone's down.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.03,1:20:53.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 喂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.53,1:20:54.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-没有讯号 -别无选择\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-  No signal. - There's no choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.79,1:20:56.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-她说得对 -手机没有讯号\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- She's right. -  We got no signal, guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.20,1:20:58.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个 想办法打电话求救\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, you two! Find a way to call for help.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.70,1:21:00.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让大家知道发生什么事了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let everyone know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.16,1:21:01.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点 快点 往这边走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on! Come on! This way! This way!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.75,1:21:04.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你去躲起来 看到那个救生塔吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're gonna hide. See that lifeguard tower?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.46,1:21:06.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-有 -你去那里 然后待在里面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Yeah. - You go there and you stay there.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.05,1:21:09.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次千万不要再像以前那样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is not one of those things where I tell you to do something,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.55,1:21:13.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,表面答应 然后任意行事 懂吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}you say "yes," and then you do whatever you want. Understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.59,1:21:14.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,懂了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.14,1:21:16.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没在敷衍我吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're not messing with me?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.55,1:21:17.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.76,1:21:20.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若我需要担心你 就无法全力发挥\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't do what I need to do if I'm worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.98,1:21:21.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会没事的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.64,1:21:24.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,答应我你会回来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Promise me you'll come back.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.52,1:21:28.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我爱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.48,1:22:09.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.44,1:22:17.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桑尼 去查看一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sonny. Check that out.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.74,1:22:23.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 兄弟 你有手机吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, yo, my man. You got a phone?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.78,1:22:26.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都在躲避什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's everyone running from?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.58,1:22:29.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么声音\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.79,1:22:30.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三只巨齿鲨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Three megs.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.04,1:22:33.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们三人 每人骑一台水上摩托车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Three of us. We each grab a jet ski.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.75,1:22:36.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让它们来追我们 远离人群 游向外海\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Get them to chase it away from these people and out to sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.92,1:22:38.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我们再用鱼叉攻击它们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Then we harpoon them.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.25,1:22:42.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是指那些东贴西补 不知会致命还是索命的鱼叉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, you mean with those jerry-rigged, maybe-they-work, maybe-they-kill-us harpoons?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.38,1:22:43.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.38,1:22:44.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这主意烂透了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's a terrible idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.05,1:22:46.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有更好的主意吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You got a better one?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.22,1:22:47.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.43,1:22:48.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那么我们就算同意了 -对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Then we're agreed. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.06,1:22:50.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-很好 -好极了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Good. - Great.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.32,1:23:06.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蒙提斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Montes!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.78,1:23:09.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.64,1:23:39.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们走传统路线好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let's go old school.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.53,1:23:47.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,市内电话也断线了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The landline's down, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.48,1:23:49.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 四周没人 我们上吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, coast is clear. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.99,1:23:57.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们竟然会走路\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They can walk?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.70,1:23:59.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.21,1:24:02.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那些怪物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's those things.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.62,1:24:05.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们还没发现我们 好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They haven't spotted us yet. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.59,1:24:12.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还装了些什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What else you got in here?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.18,1:24:14.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紧急应变用品\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Emergency stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.22,1:24:18.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好喔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.68,1:24:23.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗 保险套\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? Condoms?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.10,1:24:25.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是不同类型的紧急情况\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Different kind of emergencies.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.98,1:24:26.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把那个递给我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hand me that.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.65,1:24:32.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把嘴里的口香糖给我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now hand me that gum in your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.78,1:24:35.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.63,1:24:50.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有一台水上摩托车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's only one ski.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.38,1:24:51.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把你们的鱼叉给我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Give me your harpoons.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.75,1:24:54.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.43,1:25:01.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-交给我吧 -祝你好运\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- I got this. -  Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.26,1:25:03.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要更强大的火力\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We need more firepower.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.22,1:25:05.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.93,1:25:09.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有个主意 我们走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I have an idea. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.15,1:25:19.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次不行 泰勒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not this time, Taylor.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.88,1:25:39.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（欢乐岛）
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.42,1:25:42.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该就是这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This should be the place.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.97,1:25:46.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.35,1:25:54.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在找什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are we looking for?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.23,1:25:57.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,硝酸铵\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ammonium nitrate.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.15,1:26:00.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要制造炸弹\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're making a bomb?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.57,1:26:02.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这东西的威力和黄色炸药一样强大\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This stuff is as powerful as TNT.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.90,1:26:06.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进去 进去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Get in! Get in!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.41,1:26:12.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不准动\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.51,1:26:31.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.50,1:27:04.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加油啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.10,1:27:18.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来 去看看他有没有电话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, let's see if he's got a phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.14,1:27:24.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我拿到卫星电话了 我拿到…\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I got the sat phone. I got the sat...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.19,1:27:25.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我拿到电话了 你为何要偷他的钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I got the phone. Why you stealing his money?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.90,1:27:27.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎样 反正他又不需要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? He's not gonna need it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.44,1:27:32.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乖狗狗 乖狗狗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nice doggies. Nice doggies.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.90,1:27:33.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 芮格斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, Rigas.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.90,1:27:35.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,数到三 我们就狂奔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}On the count of three, we're gonna bolt.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.40,1:27:38.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一 二 三\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}One. Two. Three!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.45,1:27:39.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么 喂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What the hell? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.03,1:27:43.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等DJ 等等DJ\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait for DJ! Wait for DJ!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.87,1:27:47.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们就在我们身后\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They're right behind us!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.08,1:27:50.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们躲进里面 快点 快进来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let's hide in here! Come on. Come on. Come here. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.38,1:27:53.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-搞什么  -嗨 DJ 嗨 芮格斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- What the hell? - Hi, DJ. Hi, Rigas.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.50,1:27:55.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有人一起 靠在墙上 手举高\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All of you together. Up against the wall. Hands up!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.97,1:27:59.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若我是你 就不会用那东西指着我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wouldn't point that at me if I were you. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.22,1:28:02.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴 双手举高\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Shut it! Keep your hands in the air.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.30,1:28:03.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,举手啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hands up!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.14,1:28:08.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想伤害你们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't want to hurt you,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.02,1:28:10.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我要给你们一次机会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}so I'm going to give you one chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.52,1:28:12.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放下那些武器\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Put those weapons down.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.31,1:28:14.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然你会怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Or you'll do what?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.65,1:28:17.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别动 小矮子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Stay still, little guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.74,1:28:24.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 乔 乔 小心门\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no! Joe, Joe, door!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.28,1:28:26.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们不准动\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Stay where you are!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.95,1:28:29.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-快走 -找掩护\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Go, go! -  Get to cover!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.76,1:28:48.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Damn!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.18,1:28:53.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有讯号了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I got signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.56,1:28:54.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打电话求助\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Call for help!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.56,1:28:56.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后前往海滩帮助别人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}To get down to the beach and help people!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.90,1:28:57.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要去哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.98,1:28:59.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-偷一架直升机 -什么直升机\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Stealing a chopper. -  What chopper?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.23,1:29:01.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全球救援\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Global rescue?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.61,1:29:04.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要救援 需要你派出所有手下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We need rescue! We need you to send everybody you got!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.53,1:29:07.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,国民警卫队 救生员 海岸巡防队 任何人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The National Guard, the lifeguard, the Coast Guard. Anybody!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.74,1:29:08.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快来就对了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just come now!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.01,1:30:17.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来其他人也有同样想法\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ugh, looks like someone else had the same idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.26,1:30:20.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要一个计画\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We need a plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.64,1:30:23.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须把它引开 然后偷走直升机\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We have to lead it away and steal the chopper.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.18,1:30:25.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 你去引它 我去偷直升机\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, you lead it away, I'll steal the chopper.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.35,1:30:28.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你来分散注意力 我去开直升机 -为什么是我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You distract it, I'll get the chopper. Why me?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.94,1:30:30.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会驾驶直升机\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can you fly a chopper?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.28,1:30:31.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 我会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I can.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.28,1:30:32.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你有驾照  -对 我有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- You have a license? - Yes, I do!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.82,1:30:33.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-真没想到 -什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- I didn't know that. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.94,1:30:35.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成交 好计画\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, good plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.32,1:30:36.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麦克\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mac!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.19,1:31:16.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,九溟 我们得走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jiuming! We gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.32,1:31:25.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,燃料 去拿燃料\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fuel! Get the fuel!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.20,1:31:26.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,汽油 我们需要汽油\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Gas! We need gas!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.37,1:31:34.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起飞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Get up!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.05,1:31:41.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把油枪拔掉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Get the fuel!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.76,1:31:49.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蜥蜴来袭 抓紧了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Lizard incoming! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.22,1:31:51.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,九溟 九溟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jiuming? Jiuming!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.94,1:32:03.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快跑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.66,1:32:11.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.70,1:32:16.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好耶\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whoa, yay!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.62,1:32:21.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟 没想到你能成功逃生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Man, I didn't think you were gonna make that one.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.18,1:32:31.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快逃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.90,1:32:46.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.59,1:33:14.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要去哪里 乔纳斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Where are you going, Jonas?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.17,1:33:57.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞低一点 那是玫盈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Get lower! That's Meiying!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.09,1:33:59.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定是玫盈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you sure it's Meiying?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.31,1:34:06.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再飞低一点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Get lower!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.47,1:34:08.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啦 抓紧了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, okay! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.78,1:34:24.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玫盈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Meiying!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.66,1:34:27.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Over here!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.91,1:34:31.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跳起来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Leap up!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.87,1:35:56.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乔纳斯竟然还活着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jonas is still alive?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.53,1:35:57.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,载我过去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Get me over there!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.12,1:36:04.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.88,1:36:07.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓住 玫盈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hang on, Meiying!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.18,1:36:24.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,泰勒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Taylor!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.40,1:36:29.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出来啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.90,1:36:34.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快从桥下出来 小坏蛋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come out from under the bridge, little troll!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.34,1:37:00.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,游戏终于要结束了 对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}End of the line, no?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.05,1:37:02.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I guess it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.22,1:37:04.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你手上有枪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You got the gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.56,1:37:10.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会需要这个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I won't be needing this.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.19,1:37:15.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道你下不了手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I knew you couldn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.24,1:37:20.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回头见 鱼饲料\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See you later, chum.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.87,1:37:26.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,舅\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jiu!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.08,1:37:29.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玫盈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Meiying!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.62,1:37:32.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把篓里的炸弹扔给我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Throw me the bomb!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.37,1:37:33.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在哪里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Where?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.92,1:37:35.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Catch it!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.54,1:39:09.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坚持住 我来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hold on! I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.63,1:39:14.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玫盈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Meiying!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.05,1:39:16.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玫盈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Meiying!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.10,1:39:18.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乔纳斯 在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}-  Jonas! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.93,1:39:21.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你还好吗  -很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- You okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.60,1:39:23.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,九溟舅舅和麦克有麻烦了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uncle Jiuming and Mac's in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.19,1:39:29.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,待在这里 我马上回来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Stay here. I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.82,1:39:40.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麦克 你还好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mac! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.53,1:39:41.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麦克\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mac?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.46,1:40:40.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来啊 你这个丑八怪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, you ugly bastard!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.52,1:41:38.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快来 快来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.68,1:41:40.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来 我接住你们了 来吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, come on. I got you, I got you. Come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.85,1:41:42.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点 小心 小心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on! Watch, watch, watch it!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.65,1:41:44.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来啊 来啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:46.86,1:41:48.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玫盈 你怎么在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Meiying, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.98,1:41:50.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必须救这只狗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I had to save the dog!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.86,1:41:51.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.57,1:41:53.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mommy's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.57,1:41:55.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-谢谢你 谢谢你 -不客气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Thank you! Thank you! - You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.66,1:42:01.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行 你休想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no, you don't!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.71,1:42:02.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玫盈 过来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Meiying! Come!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.84,1:42:14.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这样 吃屎吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hell yeah! Get some!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.72,1:42:17.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是谁说点50口径不实用的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who says a .50 caliber is an impractical round?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.81,1:42:24.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 等等 等等\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey! Wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.56,1:42:26.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都保持静止 不要动\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Everyone stay still. No motion.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.27,1:42:29.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 没事的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.15,1:42:31.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是海琪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's Haiqi.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.65,1:42:33.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁在乎是哪一只\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who cares which one it is?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.99,1:42:34.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它会听我的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She'll listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.15,1:42:37.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家散开 这样就不会全被吃了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let's spread out so that thing don't get us all.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.61,1:42:38.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能搞定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I got this!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.85,1:43:12.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好耶 我就知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes! I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.81,1:43:16.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就跟你们说 我们心有灵犀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I told you! We have a special bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.36,1:43:18.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-它去追海豚了 -才怪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- It went after the dolphins. -  No!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.32,1:43:20.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它听从了我的指令\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She obeyed my command.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.11,1:43:22.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真可笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.70,1:43:26.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以前就不信 现在更不信\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I didn't believe it before and I don't believe it now.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.24,1:43:27.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 麦克 支援一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Mac, back me up.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.28,1:43:29.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在它改变主意前我要先离开这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm getting out of here before she changes her mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.08,1:43:31.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麦克\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mac!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.08,1:43:33.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们继续留在这里争论\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You guys stay there and argue.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.04,1:43:35.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它听从了我的指令\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She obeyed my command!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.09,1:43:38.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-海豚 -才怪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Dolphins. - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.05,1:43:46.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的不是我的错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not my fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.84,1:43:49.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时遇到突发状况 看到坏事发生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sometimes, there's a situation, and bad things are happening,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.22,1:43:50.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你非得插手不可\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and you just have to get involved.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.60,1:43:54.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴你终于了解了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm glad you finally understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.60,1:43:57.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以你为荣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.98,1:44:02.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下次别再乱跑了 行吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Next time don't run around, ok?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.40,1:44:08.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,营救一号呼叫欢乐岛 结束\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rescue One to Fun Island. Over.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.82,1:44:11.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴听到你的声音 老兄\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, it's good to hear your voice, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.74,1:44:13.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有很多需要帮助的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We got a lot of people who need help.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.12,1:44:20.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 我以前不会游泳 但后来…\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I used to didn't know how to swim, but then, you know,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.33,1:44:23.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要去外面追鲨鱼 就最好快点学会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}you out there chasing sharks, you better learn how to swim quick!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.30,1:44:26.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水是冷 但也不是那么冷 但没错…\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The water was cold. It wasn't that cold, but yeah,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.38,1:44:28.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我其实玩得很开心 -海琪怎么办\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- I was just having fun! -  What about Haiqi?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.13,1:44:31.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它还在外面 也许怀孕了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's still out there. Maybe pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.51,1:44:32.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最好不要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, preferably not.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.05,1:44:35.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个明天再说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.35,1:44:37.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天 我们先珍惜现况\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Today, we count our blessings.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.35,1:44:39.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这杯感谢我们还活着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here's to being alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.14,1:44:42.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这杯敬海豚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here's to dolphins.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.10,1:44:45.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敬老天保佑玫盈平安\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}To Meiying being safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.61,1:44:48.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更敬莎尔 兰斯 和寇蒂斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And here's to Sal, Lance, and Curtis.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.78,1:44:52.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以…\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:53.20,1:44:54.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还会被禁足吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}am I still grounded?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.83,1:44:59.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-绝对会 -绝对会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Absolutely. - Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.04,1:45:06.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个太可笑了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You two are ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.38,1:45:09.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但无论如何我都爱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I love you anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.76,1:45:16.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来之前你有点鲁莽了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Looks like you got a little reckless out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.88,1:45:19.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 一切完全在掌控之中\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, everything was totally under control.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:19.97,1:45:21.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最好是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:21.35,1:45:24.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是现在一切都快要完全失控了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, everything's about to be totally not under control.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.23,1:45:27.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干杯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Give me some.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.03,1:45:34.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 真是好酒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, that's the good stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:24.57,1:55:28.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《巨齿鲨２：海沟深渊》
Dialogue: 0,1:55:28.99,1:55:30.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,字幕翻译：张君怡
